\end{align*}

\noindent
uniformly in $\xi_1, \dots,\xi_k \in [-\overline L_\varepsilon, \overline L_\varepsilon]^k $, where  $\mathcal{E}_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k}$ and $\textup{Det}_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k}$ are defined in Proposition (PROP:cha of the paper).","status":"unverified"}

