{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.701191+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ec72f45f630d592dea970f40e7fe057e216e5ae091dafc5719c557dabc531b6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor GHProps of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Under Condition~(ConditionThm1 of the paper), the following events hold wvhp with respect to $G \sim \mu_{\lambda,\zeta}$. Setting $\overline \Delta:=\mathbb{E}_{\lambda,\zeta} \Delta(G)$,
