{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.790933+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f1a9399c089f2765dd0bfc18599580439f776663941c3349e36a2bb34bf4ec2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition lem:moment of arXiv:2606.10973, 'Quasisymmetric rigidity of the Brownian sphere'] \begin{enumerate}
