{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.436635+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6faf7d4f7b04e20ae3f47f1fecace7eeac85057d0360f15c70ac1715cb593c77","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Inequalities of arXiv:2508.09291, '1+O(1) asymptotics for loop percolation in five and higher dimensions'] Define an event $A$ as increasing if $\eta\in A$ satisfies $\eta+\zeta\in A$ for all $\zeta$. Then for increasing $A,B$, the \textnormal{(FKG-inequality)} holds:
