{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.616926+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6fc217fd20df3f5063c0480a65e11111365c458bef56bb3a8e040f4aced353f0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2506.09592, 'Extremal process of the local time of simple\\random walk on a regular tree'] For all~$\lambda\ge0$,
