in $D^{2}$ with the weak $M_{1}$ topology. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.588868+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6fdf77fe5d776482964a20a45a2d1f68d95e45054a97003048e87bbaa0320052","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Generator Bounds of arXiv:2507.12502, 'Quantitative Edge Eigenvector Universality for Random Regular Graphs: Berry-Esseen Bounds '] The generator of the backward process applied to $V$ satisfies:
