{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.801891+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_703da528db02a516c612551ca07628592a378fa0b7c19bf2fa21e26e2a752fab","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm l:restricted-L-properties of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] Almost surely, the following properties hold for every $R = (s_0,t_0) \times (x_0,y_0) \in \mathcal{R}$.
    \begin{enumerate}[label={\rm(\roman*)}]
