{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:06:18.054559+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_70f16106ef406e49ef73ac6e5f71ccbfed013c190951974b57f741cd2de1dbd5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2608.15914, 'Absorption cutoff and stationary singularities for rounded Gaussian random dynamical syste'] The threshold in \cref{eq:subcritical-lattice-threshold} belongs to
