{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:53:00.818024+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_71192915cddc138f818264f6ca107ee15919e10577b0f20d8f525cca8ac6c89b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm: Main Theorem of arXiv:2607.17393, 'Optimal Covariance Estimates for Schr\"odinger Semigroups with White Noise in $d=1,2$'] It holds that
\begin{align}

