{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:24:45.943028+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_711bb88809f04fcfa595d6f62efb1a03bcef48b462743bda0554e5b58c3c253a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:compensator of arXiv:2509.10984, 'Weak Existence and Uniqueness for Super-Brownian Motion with Irregular Drift'] The compensator of $\mathfrak{P}^{(n)}$ is given by
