{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:25:41.654383+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_716d17f3c162be99146a39c74f58ac5c60fb581bceb9576b27a46fa2d5ee6abe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:levy-symbol-summability of arXiv:2608.15923, 'Universality of two-dimensional Markovian holonomy fields'] Let $\psi:\widehat G\to\mathbb{C}$ be the symbol of an admissible L\'evy process. For every $s>0$ and $M\ge0$,
