{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.331675+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_71874c4689ff1429c87469b999c1bcda619c3aa63f1a3efadab8e395c290497b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:IW-check of arXiv:2609.04045, 'Heat content and spectrum for subordinated sub-Laplacians'] For any $0<\alpha<2$, the subordinated process $B^{(\alpha)}$ satisfies conditions (equation cond1 of the paper)-(equation cond2 of the paper) of Theorem~(thm:Ikeda-Watanabe of the paper) with 
