    Constants $C_{\lambda,\mu,n}'$, $C_{\lambda,\mu,n}''$ and $A_{\lambda,\mu,n}$ are defined in (equation eq: subexpo L-p norm JSQ of the paper) and (equation eq: MGF upper bound JSQ of the paper), respectively. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.982662+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_725c56122acd8f0693f3d7ac0273dca51885d320b86c7b1cd1520dc6da73be3c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi of arXiv:2412.05999, 'Non-Archimedean GUE corners and Hecke modules'] Let $L(G^{\alt},K)$ (resp. $L(G^{+{\alt}},K)$) denote the space of all complex-valued continuous functions of compact support on $G^{\alt}=G\cap\Alt_{2n}(F)$ (resp. $G^{+{\alt}}=G^+\cap\Alt_{2n}(\mathfrak{o})$) which are invariant with respect to $K$, i.e., such that

