{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.018981+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_72fa1a01341cd67a1d1f44b4b67b83095b96bebd8475bfa547b816bac1213472","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 6 (Markov setting) of arXiv:2605.05986, '\bf Convergence rate of the occupation measure of { classes of ergodic processes toward th'] Let $(P_t)_{t\ge0}$ denote a  Markov transition semi-group defined on bounded $\R$-valued Borel functions defined on $\R^d$. Let $\mu_0\!\in {\cal P}_q(\R^d)$ for some $q> 1$ 
