{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:48:25.153200+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_730b5c881e656a2c2b52e41c6bdbd5c74cc2ac65079625f22e2b8b702591bf72","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:main of arXiv:2607.05345, 'The local product condition implies cutoff'] For any $0<\varepsilon\le 1/2$, we have
