\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:48:24.304561+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73867caf28b060bcb4c05008df7eaa24a3f9c685161ffb513bb5c97f297d47d5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem firstlem of arXiv:2605.27949, 'Yaglom limits of continuous-state branching processes in Brownian random environment \than'] For any $z>0,\lambda>0,$ we have
