{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.628179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73d7e1d244148b80a437d39e1b0cb29840b67024563899e46b64a810cc4e8e4b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:structure of arXiv:2607.00800, 'Brownian motion in Minkowski normed spaces'] Under \textnormal{(H1)--(H3)}, the following hold.
