{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.230388+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73e6c6183e5606c462d4d0e29780e7e061cc6c337de02fc8e322b58df506cf87","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 22 of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] If $n\ge k$, then any positive Borel function $f$ on $\bf{GL}(k,n)$ satisfies
	\begin{multline}
