{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:32:56.091210+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7420bfbd1e52a18cf4962965b9e4c388bdabd820a8e6581ffa9e2e3cbadcee33","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Def1 definition:snakePath of arXiv:2411.12717, 'Excursion theory for Markov processes indexed by Lévy trees'] Fix $(\mu , {\mathrm{w}}) \in \Theta$.  An element  $(\upvarrho , \omega) \in 
