{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.831827+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_742bd7b2811cbab5ddf9c5d02ec45a976861232ca7c2b3eff2194fa7303d7b78","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:system-rewrite-detailed of arXiv:2609.00556, 'Higgs--Demailly System and Positivity of Higgs Bundles'] Let $h_t=e^{-f_t}g_t h_{\rm ref}$, where $g_t>0$ is
$h_{\rm ref}$-Hermitian and $\det g_t=1$.  Then
\begin{equation}
