{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.524168+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7477bb420cb027db566448e8fab9c57743331be5e951aa71e119f80aa3d9eb4c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn def:Hlambda of arXiv:2411.03482, 'Ergodicity of 2D singular stochastic Navier--Stokes equations'] For any $\lambda > 0$, set $\mathcal{H}_{\lambda,i} = \Delta_{i + \log^{+}_{2}(\lambda)}$ and define the projections 
