{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:58.356403+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_74bba7ab3a2d67173eb139b2d14aad4980829232fa913e8ace80be232d43fc78","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2506.18313, 'A stochastic model for the diffusion of competing opinions with trend-following, oppositio'] Assume that $(\xi_n)$ satisfies, for some integer $m\ge 1$ and for some real number $h > 2m$, that
