{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.724920+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_74e8ce10538906189e888a138001cc39a3ab2672cabc575b6313fe6f94e3e51a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th: affine formula of arXiv:2411.04238, 'Holomorphic jump-diffusions'] Set $X_0=x_0\in S$, fix $\mathbf{u}\in \mathcal V^*$, and suppose that the following conditions hold true.
