{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.020391+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_752d785d9f205a3f0d50b19344e1ca41ca98fced36d9cb17a0dcbe325a34f802","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:perc-Pip of arXiv:2605.15545, 'Crossover from subcritical to critical decay: \\ random walk, self-avoiding walk, percolat'] Let $d \ge 15$
and $a \in [0,d-1]$.
For any choice of $q \in [1,\infty]$ satisfying
