{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:44:12.637716+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7592270cb40c31748909f7c42e69ac3bf05ef228014b2a5b93f1fede14a6d111","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:poly-approx-lip-network of arXiv:2512.04371, 'Constructive Approximation under Carleman's Condition, \\ with Applications to Smoothed An'] Let $\mu$ be a distribution on $\RR^d$.  

