{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:46.876921+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_75beb5c19e014b5ab7a8f061361bc89d24a6d9a77083ecb0791caf91f12b79a7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:bubble-separator of arXiv:2608.09368, 'A proof of Ross's conjecture for two-site moving-target search'] For any words $u,v$,
