{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.969456+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_75c8dc059b02b80d3ecc3416fcac7da2fa2ddb0928e88e36dba9421b5706f2cc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:mainthm of arXiv:2411.07125, 'Mixing on the cycle with constant size perturbation'] Considering the upper bound: for any $\delta>0$ target exception probability there exist $\gamma(\delta)<\infty$ 
