{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.761090+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_765da18ced26ba906fadfc04db51689a74263d24a03fe3dfa7340916eff5028c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 12 of arXiv:2604.12233, 'An upper bound on the smallest singular value of dense random combinatorial matrices'] Let $p \in(0, 1/2]$ be a fixed constant.
