{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.876105+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76cf2d45ac5a92e935a3d52ddc4f7e2c0257d2d121aace64008a13f7486e7cf2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 56 (Second-order singular group-dual transfer) of arXiv:2607.16724, 'Algebraic Transfer for Operator-Valued Gaussian Chaoses: Oriented Schatten Profiles and Si'] Assume \eqref{eq:group-growth}, let
$D/4<\sigma\le D/2$, $c_x=\langle x\rangle^{-\sigma}$, and fix
