{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.898201+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76ed7bff79797875dcaedf85b8dd0345afaf58d5452d8e670093d755c1c46f7b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 16 of arXiv:2608.02103, '$p$-Adic Diffusion and Random Walks on $[0,1]$'] In a subdivision the following characterization holds:
