{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.870302+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76ee0197c8325ccd007b2e696104079119499b5e45452b49bfdb0db6d65bb694","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture of arXiv:2512.19897, 'On the convoy of the ASEP speed process'] Conditionally on the event $U_0 = u$ with $x = \tfrac{1+u}{2}$, the size of the ASEP convoy is asymptotically a universal folded normal random variable. More specifically, we have
