{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.716818+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7719beb845e7c88b05e70062a61ed7f702c659a4e124e9cc00bd40aabf1f01b3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:exMetr of arXiv:2604.16206, 'Extrapolation of max--stable random fields with Fr\'echet marginals'] Let  the random vector $\mathbf{X}$ be as in Theorem (Em:MC:l of the paper).
