{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.540125+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7754509e7caf1665c05bd07fea34421a7ea41439cae85e7c5b76655411865514","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LS of arXiv:2510.22701, 'Gaussian fluctuations in Mean Field Stable matchings'] For $d>2$, we have that
