{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:27.586656+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77ada912bc74aa8b2afcd2e97f10b417bd5abba7b292f2cddb5c7cff2f53a68f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 48 of arXiv:2603.00353, 'Aldous-type Spectral Gaps in Unitary Groups'] Let $n\ge3$ and let $\Gamma=([n],w)$ be a hypergraph with non-negative weights supported on subsets of size $n-1$. For every $k\in\Z_{\ge1}$ consider the $n\times n$ matrix\marginpar{$M_k$}
