{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.711119+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77df1dd00cb7ceb466dc901e8d6f80b1a177a37d9a05705982e5ef8c9ec568df","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 (Bounds for lower-chaos contraction kernels) of arXiv:2608.29726, '\LARGE A Priori Estimates for Singular Fractional Stochastic Burgers Equations'] Assume
