{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:55:27.256395+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77fd3c6a3b788b0d0ea9da4daa6f5675b820b6f1f42dfcf0f8028ce27b32f84f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop weyl3 of arXiv:2609.04092, 'Short character sums of inhomogeneous polynomials'] Let $0<L_2\leq L_1$ and $0<\theta \leq \log L_2 / \log L_1$.
