{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.607259+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_780d23c4864f1b973ff26ef176237c4399ccdcbef8b674e680139b03bde86381","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2607.08242, 'Convergence of random sums in non-commutative probability'] Let $\{N_n\}$ be non-negative integer-valued rvs

