{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.159069+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7893ae402c6ccbc5329a39ec65bbcff19b4e643f7ea2432af857b321b71e0646","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2607.02406, 'On the range of competing random walks'] Suppose that $|A\cup B|(d-\beta)<d$. Then
