	\sup_N \sup_{t \in [0,T]}\widetilde{\mathfrak{m}}_p^N(t) \;<\; \infty\,,
\end{equation*}
where $\widetilde{\mathfrak{m}}_p^N(t):=\E[(Z^N(t))^p]$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:25:35.657630+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_790932606d4c3679ee661bcfd364530e47efffc314ec4441d8a7d9eb0553b96d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition planarity_estimate of arXiv:2603.05491, '\textbf{Local limits of uniform triangulations with boundaries in high genus}'] Let $\varepsilon > 0$. 
There exists $C_{\varepsilon} > 0$ such that for all $g \ge 0$ and $n \ge 2g-1$ with $\frac{g}{n} \le \frac{1}{2} - \varepsilon$, 
any $k \ge 0$, and sequences $\mathbf{p}_1,\dots,\mathbf{p}_k$ with 
