{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:47:53.355079+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_794e802850227d381c326c07d4e16cad4348b31de55c52475f8c4e637d52a179","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2607.16017, 'On large networks of integrate-and-fire neurons with short-term synaptic plasticity'] We have the representation 
