                                &\subseteq (B_{3n^{2/3+\delta}}(\LL_{-2\n}^{2\n}))^2\cap ([\![-(1+\gamma/2)n, -(1-\gamma/2)n]\!]_{\RR})\times [\![(1-\gamma/2)n,(1+\gamma/2)n]\!]_{\RR}). 
