{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:56:00.650413+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a3abf0782ddab3fd019cf099e47c9f7c1252b08a53fbcb6d50a3dff485fa41f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor_Ystochastic of arXiv:2603.29442, 'A compact support property for infinite-dimensional SDEs with Hölder continuous coefficien'] Suppose Assumption~(assumption1 of the paper) holds. 
