{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:39:18.535651+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a7b1ddb93528515f5d860257135bdfe2741cea2063cc84bd7d1b4be3e3f81f2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2609.02294, 'Existence and Blow-Up for Non-linear Fokker-Planck with Controlled Drift Divergence'] For almost every $s$, given any maximizer $A_{t,s}$, it holds
