{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.993685+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a7ca9a5373b55b0b9dfe16efa0d6fcedd3ca5a286211f2dfe5fbc0a36a2dc86","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 36 of arXiv:2609.03386, 'Twisted Gradient Flow Approach to Vegetation-Rainfall-Bushfire Interactions Model'] The following uniform estimate holds: 

