{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.781030+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b6bfcc0b6c3ac7573c0182bfd237c3e0bae6ecb22f1d6be54c357daed184b9a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 7 of arXiv:2603.29549, 'Multitype PCR branching processes'] For any $n\in \mathbb Z$, 
