{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.899645+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b7a4cbe975537aa318f3b59d8ae29c53e49bbdbe310e04986626e7402b6cae5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2606.20816, 'Spectral Properties of Dense Barab\'asi--Albert Graphs'] Let $r_0 < r_1$ be integers and $a, b \in \C$ such that the Gamma terms below are defined. Then
