     \bigg\lVert \Big(\hfixpa(\hfixp_0;\cdot,t_\ell)\Big)_{\ell \in \lbr K \rbr} -  \Big(\hfixp(\hfixp_0;\cdot,t_\ell)\Big)_{\ell \in \lbr K \rbr}  \bigg\rVert_{\textup{TV}} \leq \varepsilon^{\prime} 
