{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.708128+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7bae50d49127844cd87fdc4a986cc1f36940cf71bb43f70234bd385d39115f61","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop key-prop of arXiv:2605.29095, 'Asymptotics of the number of components of random polynomial lemniscates'] With $Q_n, R_n, S_n, O_n$ defined as above, 
