{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.693101+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7baf0a9605de95e2d6625d0c362e0431081772ac0fad5006aadfa83776ae28d4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p:3.9nn of arXiv:2602.21277, 'A Limit in Law for the Cover Time and Last Visited Vertex of Wired Planar Domains'] \begin{equation}

