{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.852513+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7baf5bb082d08c97b6dbe53013645cacba08bd288281556e403a79906f2b66c4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:ErdosTaylor of arXiv:2509.16694, 'A central limit theorem for two-dimensional directed polymers with critical spatial correl'] As $N\to\infty$, the following convergence in distribution holds
\begin{equation} 
