then the covariance of $Y$ has finite $\frac{1}{2H}$-variation, and
    $$ \left\| R_Y \right\|_{\frac{1}{2H}-var;[s,t]^2} \lesssim  c_H|t-s|^{2H}, \text{ for } 0\leq s\leq t\leq T. $$ (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

