{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.545094+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7beb4697e41089cfb8af97ab83aec2a266b79e494c7feb47732a8cccb8f08f5e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:fk of arXiv:2603.28161, 'Boundary four-point connectivities of conformal loop ensembles'] Let $R_{\rm{FK}}(\lambda)=\frac{P^{(12)(34)}_{\rm{FK}}(x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4)}{P^{\rm total}_{\rm{FK}}(x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4)}$, and for $x\in(0,1)$, define
