{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:24:45.943711+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7c4cff0a13a7968a639485e9f476bcdfb920ab25d8b6883249e1a2cee6419774","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:lpconv of arXiv:2509.10984, 'Weak Existence and Uniqueness for Super-Brownian Motion with Irregular Drift'] There exists $T_0>0$ such that 
