{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.498529+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ce8a1e0779bca67fec07a60551d3707ef2a12b33f5d33f861b01c6ddf59bf3e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:RBJ-seed-linear of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] Let $H = \ell^2(\mathbb{Z})$.  The seed functions
