{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:56:11.133175+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d12c8e6a5ade96100461f0a3d39f0e88e85563d0c31456e29107cb56e1c0896","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2608.10515, 'Limiting Law of Local Fields for the Mean Field Ghatak-Sherrington Model'] There exists $\beta_0>0$ such that for $\beta\le\beta_0$ we have
