{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:06:39.258036+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d1a6bb375d7baec3afc1f26a927143d2ffba9479ca99887de842a689fddd363","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:hittingtime of arXiv:2607.08914, 'Linear spreading speed in non-monotone population models'] There are $0<v_1<v_2<\infty$ and $\Cl{c:htsmall},\Cl{c:htbig}\in(0,\infty)$
