{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:15:46.798248+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d1f51fbba48081b510ffa58c910ffbffabd0f7585ab1c82fe9d22cf94f1d8a0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[OPEN PROBLEM - not a proved fact. Stated in arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF' (conj environment labelled Conj MKS SLE 4).] Let $n\geq 1$.
