with the convention that for each trivial diagram (i.e., a single isolated vertex), the contribution is \(N \delta_{l_i, 0}\). Here, the outer sum is taken over all vertex labelings \(\eta : V(\Gamma) \to [N]\).
Then for any integers $m_1,\dots,m_s \ge 0$,
\[
