{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:52:08.675768+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7defae3c080e2400b0db6f17130118370c26a3b56f6475445583e8efae59df2a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Maintheorem 3 of arXiv:2608.30077, 'Lie groupoid integration of singular isometries of the Poincaré disk'] The quotient
