{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.138925+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e102f4c6fa06a30c29980e17e840eaac77a9b1089751a258e0fae6d43a25398","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 17 of arXiv:2608.27569, 'Laplace and Dolbeault operators on Sasakian manifolds'] (Lefschetz decomposition on a Sasakian manifold) Any differential form $
