{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:37:08.313069+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e54c0d2dd7092fa2e14b02ca8cfaf3846d9ccfc6b9c21d7e0dde16e15e7d5fb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:stein-projection-c2 of arXiv:2608.29507, 'Denoising as Projection: Constrained Optimization with Gradient-Guided Diffusion'] Assume that Assumption (assump:data of the paper), (assump:uniform-graph of the paper) hold. Let
\begin{align}
  \textstyle r
    :=
    \min\left\{
