{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.298909+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7f352cde76b3604c238ddafede149fcd06f4023654fd8517ad1eb49f4643d3e5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:combined-early-late-numerical-time of arXiv:2608.30382, 'Convergence rates for the RMSprop optimizer with full control of the hyperparameters'] Let $\rho,c,q,C_X,L_f,C_{\mathrm{Loj}},C_{\mathrm{dec}}
