{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.231912+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7f9058084226d828fe7c5c24fc679fa07b9c9e7a02c1aaae9bf4d31da73f1564","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:discrete of arXiv:2506.15949, 'On the passage times of self-similar Gaussian processes on curved boundaries'] Suppose that $t_{n+1}-t_n = \mathcal{o}(t_n)$ as $n\to\infty$.
