{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:49:21.124108+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7f9225766cbea11eb0bafdb19907cfb0f2bba6b1552b2280c4faaa7767756de1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 32 of arXiv:2608.26642, '2608.26642'] Suppose that (\ref{RV-rq}) holds. Then for every $x\in \R$ and $s\ge 0$,
