where $K=\|D^{2}u,\partial_{t}u\|_{L_{q_{1},q_{2}}}$
and $N$ depends only $d,q_{i},q$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:48:00.287586+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7fbe691c16df2beda0eb2be1c019e53d4b00821002bde6866d72a2ed68fcb77f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm ht of arXiv:2609.03033, 'An Overview of Einstein $4$-Manifolds'] If the smooth compact oriented 4-manifold
