{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:39:18.533677+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ff422f1060abbac8cd669f5f36e86d3932c756dc488210b4d8c0c088d24f1d9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2609.02294, 'Existence and Blow-Up for Non-linear Fokker-Planck with Controlled Drift Divergence'] Assume conditions \eqref{eq:assumptions}. If
