{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:13:31.942515+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8007df6a251a2683580a102f910a2322605cda6f53d7de5d49c49d16be127406","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm legendre_duality of arXiv:2506.12171, 'The multinomial dimer model'] Fix $\Lambda$. Then $\sigma(s)$ is the Legendre dual of $F(\alpha)$, i.e. for all $s\in \mathcal{N}(\Lambda)$, 
