        \mathbb{P}\bigg(\sup_{t \in [0,T]} \frac{1}{\sqrt{n}}|b_j^{(n)}(t)^2-\tilde{b}_j^{(n)}(t)^2|>C(T,k)\frac{\log(n)^{2j}}{\sqrt{n}} \text{ for some } j \leq k\bigg) < C'(T,k)n^{-2}.
