{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.471565+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_800ef39a764f06c0d88a7882c444043286782693ce773433c3caee30dcac6902","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 33 of arXiv:2609.02561, 'NON-NEF LOCI IN MIXED CHARACTERISTIC'] With notation as above, let $S^0 \subset S$ be an open subset with $f(\Gamma)\cap S^0 \neq \emptyset$. Set $X^0 := f^{-1}(S^0)$, $D^0 := D|_{X^0}$, $f^0:=f|_{X^0}$, and ${\Gamma}^{0} := \Gamma \cap X^0$.
