\frac{\mathbf{N}_{\gamma}(\lambda)}{\lambda} \xrightarrow[\lambda \to \infty]{p} c_\gamma \mu_{\ph}(\Sigma),
\end{align}
where $ \xrightarrow{p}$ denotes convergence in probability, and the constant $c_\gamma$ satisfies
