{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.613142+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_80452e427948c6c7e326b763dae5178cd565cc9721a3148a77883dfaa2204693","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 48 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] For $1\le k\le n_0$, we have 
