{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.808856+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_80d51c062c6b694532456e8c6486c167acc208fea0255dfedd6826282a00e028","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm l:cond-reg of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] Define the event 
