{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:39:41.439815+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_818a07fdcb5d10e3a15c9cb8ca6e75c5a7ab1e66f7d6b9ea2717162f107a49dc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 24 of arXiv:2604.07370, 'Probabilistic Weyl law for twisted Toeplitz matrices with rough symbols'] Let $0<\A{1},\A{2}\leq 1$ be such that $N^{-1}\ll  \pr{\A{1}\A{2}}^{1/2}$. Let $0< 1/C\leq \widehat{q}\in S(1,\A{1},\A{2})$ such that $\widehat{q}\sim \widehat{q}_0+\Tilde{h}\widehat{q}_1+...$ in $S(1,\A{1},\A{2})$. Then, 
    \begin{equation}
        \begin{split}
            \log\det&\pr{\widehat{q}_{N,\A{1},\A{2}}}\\
