{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.242019+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81ddaefd10a9eece716dd51e1b0a8ad59034e1c9a56553de300b73546d18a418","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 32 of arXiv:2608.20635, 'Minimax Optimality of Score-Entropy Discrete Diffusion'] Consider the absorbing rate matrix (equation eq:absorbing of the paper), then for any $p_0$,  

	\begin{align*}
