{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:44.525591+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81e5210e5ea2cc3c9b4b9b39c7fb8fa0d158d89ce9dd030812250aed232ffe9f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2604.01701, '\bf Chung-type laws of the iterated logarithm for $m$-fold weighted integrated fractional '] We have that
