{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:28.182630+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_820c0eb551490cb4d9f4214ff5e2c65f410326e259165543380f950ce685eedb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Xdev of arXiv:2511.10630, 'Cutoff for generalised Bernoulli--Laplace urn models'] Suppose $\mathbf{x} \in \mathrm{Meso}(N)$. Then, for all $t \geqslant 0$ and $\Delta>0$, we have
