{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.162122+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8263a5dc10bd59d3219c6dec156e9ac9943c39bd1b357f7d00d2b839bd316187","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor: tori gluing of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] For every $f \in C^\infty(\mathcal M) \subset C^\infty(M)$,
