\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.857942+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_826746ad8dbd2028141d52ec0d96618cd8fcd5ffe696c9704cc4e3320b0e5a71","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 19 of arXiv:2608.21063, '\textbf{Non-bijective scaling limits and phase transitions of planar maps}'] As $n\to\infty$,
