{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.241384+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82a0b1b42e9b79b158e005390c99e619d3049a88ffbd392407ad6e24301190b3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:survivor-image-basis of arXiv:2608.29719, 'Persistence Pairing Graphs: Tracking Changes of Selected Homology Bases'] The classes
