{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:53:30.547049+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82ba063e12cd98d3c49fc58dcc5959c9d516fb0869c97d647fe3ad36a5928891","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop-brackets of arXiv:2505.24043, 'Weak solutions of Navier-Stokes Equation with purely discontinuous L\'evy Noise'] If  $M$ and $N$ are  two square integrable  martingales taking values in Hilbert space $(X, \langle .,.\rangle_{X})$, then 
