{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.282028+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82fe755ec2ad1ef2140eb3675b5cb2f2d7459be5db2dc7e4e908a0dc9bdd2b56","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 33 of arXiv:2606.22611, 'Upper and Lower Bounds on Expected Soft Maxima\\of Gaussian Processes'] For any $\nu\in \eP(T)$ and $\bm{\mu}\in \eP(T^N)$,
