{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.652085+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_832436018e79430061a7c138544a18f3def81155a43f726cd7522961c774db52","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 24 ({See \cite[Theorem 4.33) of arXiv:2609.00723, 'An integral Hyodo--Kato isomorphism'] {Ya}}] For every $\sA=(A,L)\in \mathrm{PreLog}_{(k,N)}$,
