{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.593588+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_83a9d8f73dc3c64aaa9979cbba76a41800b864ca47523abfef8076138ae22670","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-3.6 of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] For all $\beta>0$, $n\ge k\ge0$ and~$q\in\mathbb Z$,
