{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.778631+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_83bff43af88f4072b6547948dfde51814a2c37ce06d26f1e80f81bbc74e54689","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma gl2decomp of arXiv:2609.01990, 'Jacquet-Zagier treatment of the beyond endoscopy trace formula for \(\GL_2\)'] Let \(E\) be a well-positioned étale quadratic extension of \(\mathbb{Q}_q\) with respect to \(\theta \in \text{M}_q(\mathbb{Q}_q)\) (identify \(E\) with its image \(\iota(E)\)). If \(E\) is non-split, then 
