{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.183024+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_83f59a5bd6bcc94e64d1bcbb73a9820c158d52dcc9448d06c75c10588399f974","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2606.30080, 'Ergodicity of reflected stochastic reaction-diffusion equations driven by space-time white'] Let $u$ be the solution of equation \eqref{1.1} with initial value $f$. 
