{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.896221+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_84167e853602856acac0aa18fbb13367b63799d169c66f0faf04e5621ad86da1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2609.00867, '2609.00867'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:kernel-density}, for every \(\beta\ge0\),
