{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.063003+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_841a01dda0d35d3b5690240951b9d9a548b8ad76d49ccdaf2235cf06ce245522","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary C:main-pure-rajchman of arXiv:2607.15966, 'Canonical Mandelbrot Cascades on Curves Are Rajchman'] Assume in addition that
