{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.631388+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8422681e6bad0b8384758d1c91be7798feafbdfe7e29b09321982050e1fc6577","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:Cnk of arXiv:2412.05503, 'Critical scaling profile for trees and connected subgraphs \\ on the complete graph'] Let $n \ge 3$, $N = \binom n 2$, and $t=\sqrt{3e}$.
