{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.727798+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_842392355f812ac564e6ced60527ab35b93ed130d17ecf32ecffd2d912086099","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemmas7.1 of arXiv:2608.01279, 'Stochastic heat equation with nondegenerate Hölder diffusion coefficient: uniqueness below'] Let $\mathcal{E}_n$ denote the following small constant 

