{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.984312+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8428dcb94d3fb32b95be471b4af5b785a22cc4d1cfb4f4915bd07d93a6daa10e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 (First exterior identity) of arXiv:2609.03339, 'Exterior Serrin Rigidity for the Homogeneous \texorpdfstring{$k$}{k}-Hessian Equation\\'] One has
