{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.688731+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_843960ef83e50536bd187c5223b21f165b9903a39e75cce677a3050dda0e79df","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 66 of arXiv:2608.09700, 'A general paracontrolled ansatz for singular SPDEs'] For any strong preparation map $R$, one has 
	\begin{equation} 
