{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.862174+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8542038fbb38c014c3afd8e0eb0d545bcfb6abc882dca45a61d73b4585fbe919","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2609.03084, 'Convergence rates to traveling waves for an FKPP model with nonlinear advection'] Assume that $U$ and $U_\epsilon$ solve on the positive half line
