{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.353629+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_855c48cea620d66342c7e70d2c1257926b23f8025c245061f4e76b69cfd5bb0f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 38 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] The following facts hold for all $p \in (0,1)$.
