{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.061538+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_859a9aab8b5b1a3a1e0ec508d9ae7c756f6ea528c69984add09455b942da3c2e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Q_hat_111 of arXiv:2508.04954, 'Conditional exponential directed last passage percolation under a one-point upper large de'] We have  
