provided \(n\) is sufficiently large.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.707415+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85b7ff868b2bd50e094719d5ecfdfd2a76c2554be34b5bb78ec84b08f0f6ac8d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Endpoint entropy disintegration) of arXiv:2609.02196, 'Schr\"odinger Bridges on Lie Group Manifolds for Probabilistic Intrinsic Generation'] For \(P\ll Q\), \(\Gamma=Y_\#P\), and conditional laws \(P^y,Q^y\),
