{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.822752+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85bff7df5aa37f9c90ffbe7bb2ad8d227b77589530ebb2fc989a00f84adce99c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:hetero_one_step of arXiv:2609.00193, 'Provably Efficient Federated Reinforcement Learning with Linear Function Approximation and'] Conditioned on $\mathcal C_{\mathrm{het}}$, for every agent $m\in[M]$, episode $t\in[T]$, and step $h\in[H]$,
