{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.665576+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85f017533a5086509f4da5b29ad1fa7ddf48f3b9caada2ecf174c99b45aa5190","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2604.23656, 'Doubly Reflected Backward SDEs Driven by $G$-Brownian Motion with Quadratic Generator'] For any $\alpha\geq 1$, there exists a constant $C_\alpha>0$ only depending on $\alpha$, such that 
