{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:12.026625+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85f1bd1d45e32dea7700dd93ab336f68cbb526e03eca84abd9a9ce8bf8a50178","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:borel of arXiv:2512.06984, 'Infinite Dimensional Multifractal Analysis of the Wiener measure'] Let $ (X,d) $ be a separable metric space and $ h : \mathbb R_+ \to \mathbb R_+ $ be a non decreasing function, then 
