	$p$ on the chosen compact subset of $(0,1)$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:48:24.304781+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8624e04d170a6273f3708a5d5eb42a4bec4a9d838a2daa139c728f6a0a48b03e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma keyprop0 of arXiv:2605.27949, 'Yaglom limits of continuous-state branching processes in Brownian random environment \than'] For any $p>\frac\eta2,$  we have
\begin{eqnarray}
