{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.756216+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_869f154703196106f832d77b9d5449997e175d02232e40df6884c808de24deaf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2607.09246, 'Scaling limit of 1+1 dimensional directed polymer with power-law tail and spatial correlat'] Assume that conditions \textbf{(A)} and \textbf{(B)} hold.
