in the sense of distributions, where $b$ and $H_0$ come from Proposition \ref{prop:strong-jacobi}.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:48:24.305341+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_86cb43a007ee20e8f7644a240e62d8dc524b6c3e8f57c4a185681c98d08ef504","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_survival_prob of arXiv:2605.27949, 'Yaglom limits of continuous-state branching processes in Brownian random environment \than'] In the weakly subcritical regime $({\bf m}\in(-\sigma^2,0))$, the survival probability of the process satisfies the asymptotic relationship:
