{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.531425+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_86dfee54599690592eeace629d9857cd7ea9f078769a05e2f412a8dd4bcbecca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 64 of arXiv:2609.01389, 'K-stability and birational rigidity of Fano 3-fold weighted complete intersections'] The defining polynomials of $X$ can be written as
