{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.467808+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_86f2f0f18a58d437c605ee1379b1d6d725bcec0ba0722bcec5633da2bbb7932c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor h-under-duality of arXiv:2608.27904, 'Instantons, indefinite 4-manifolds, and Dehn surgery'] For each $\vartheta^\dagger\neq 0\in Z(\widetilde C)^\dagger$, we have
