{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.290892+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_876961a1a38a2a260ced5d0d081754a25f85de7c0171e7e1742ad7a1030b07ac","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2606.23099, 'Path-dependent Affine Processes'] Assume that the linear growth condition \eqref{LG-condition-existence} holds and let $X = (X(t))_{t \in [0,T]}$ be a solution to \eqref{path_dependent_sde_existence}
