{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:05:57.823317+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87ae75d6634779444923a4f43133614f65a21257ceba001840ec49b5680818c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 33 of arXiv:2608.30570, '2608.30570'] Let $\mathcal{A}$ be a closed set in a surface $\Sigma$ with connected interior $\mathring{\mathcal{A}}$ and $D\subset \mathcal{A}$ is closed subset such that
