{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:59:45.458354+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87de0a34a1e39304471badde9976736de038c0cd70ea50cd4f0c998dd80b6686","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:evolM12 of arXiv:2411.16572, 'Optimal decay of eigenvector overlap for non-Hermitian random matrices'] For any matrices $A_1,A_2\in{\mathbb C}^{2N\times 2N}$, we have
