{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.581562+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87e88be2af1704661178a19d23a1665956866ea66d6661ab7b2034217051cb78","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:xi-model of arXiv:2602.12595, '\textbf{Michel Talagrand and the Rigorous Theory of Mean Field Spin Glasses}'] A broad class of models has centered Gaussian Hamiltonians with covariance
