{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.871158+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87ec566e7744beb6c53280c39e1960232c595721da5fe1c6288ed551134ec9b8","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 19 of arXiv:2608.29148, '2608.29148'] A pseudo-Riemannian metric $\wt g$ of signature $(2n+2, 2)$ on $\wt{\mathcal{G}}$ is called a {\it pre-ambient  metric} if it satisfies the following conditions:
