{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:03:35.765723+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87f32e2d753f92007941cca7cc0bebba6426edb868346c5f5f87c75e7eb88f6e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:ImbalanceEvolution of arXiv:2608.22910, 'A Commutator Framework for Selective Spectral Alignment in Deep Neural Networks'] Under the unregularized gradient flow \(\dot W_j=-G_j\),
