{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.760211+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87ff225469142040bcdee1470b5b650e872814d10068b5fab4da72abbdee90e4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 of arXiv:2605.14254, '2605.14254'] The infinitesimal generator $A^{\lambda,z}$ of $\zeta^{\lambda,z}$ is given by
