{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.094902+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8848ee2f346920bb9d1c4e1cb03332c6579d7cf359056aec92408dc2a16f928e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma GB of arXiv:2411.15830, 'Deformations of biorthogonal ensembles and universality'] If Assumption (assumption:sigma of the paper) (1) holds, $\mathcal G_n^{\sigma_n}[h]$ is given by
