{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.727426+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_886f7899c03216536077735224823b095f0e890953074af7c7c971a03ee7307f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma EVWox of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assuming (equation asmp:obsRG of the paper) and with sufficiently small $\epsilon' >0$,
