{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:44.252213+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_888b5976f1edd1f26e5d482f32f0b89be972581ed74b084c7d644aa609086905","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 24 of arXiv:2604.15226, '\bfseries Nonlinear Schrödinger equations with spatial white noise potential on full space'] Let $\alpha,\beta\in\IR$ and $\mu,\nu\in\IR$. We have
