{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.211161+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_891f92728758f6a97a8b7ec829f3eb5b7ff6b0d0b9ea54ba7c12ab9cb9b551cf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem head-controls of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] Let $1\ler_{\star}\le d$, let $A\in\operatorname{rip}(\delta,k)$
