{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:11.738036+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_89293442d6d0909d91b3f33c7ffab8702055de8e4933f805faeb522b3e60cb79","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma main_lemma_G of arXiv:2504.00512, 'Localization-delocalization transition for a random block matrix model at the edge'] In the setting of (mix of the paper), suppose $H_a$, $a\in [\![{D}]\!]$, take the form
