{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.975960+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_892a35b0441dbe265f406c8042244008d1228536c02a8ab4de3c1d46ca29f6e5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma thm:explicit_her_lr_coefs of arXiv:2412.05999, 'Non-Archimedean GUE corners and Hecke modules'] For any $\nu \in \Sig_n, \mu \in \Sig_{n-1}$ and $D$ large enough so that all $n$-tuples below are valid signatures, 
