{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:23.318353+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_895f4d66888d4d238fb6f53dc4c068719be77962b2b244b45aafc9c1c91ac346","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2506.20789, 'Central limit theory for Peaks-over-Threshold partial sums of long memory linear time seri'] Let $\gamma\in (0,1)$. Then the following hold:
