{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:32:56.088925+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8974d5cf06cbca370009caceba30feef43cb1c970e355f98e63e02a918657c5e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary co-incited-5 of arXiv:2411.12623, 'Random signed measures'] The representation $((representation-ultra of the paper))$ can be written as
