{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.729561+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_89833067ced10982140d1182280f4347d4b63419e639a630e511462138c3c281","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Bakry-Emery of arXiv:2604.20008, 'Mixing times of Langevin dynamics for \\ spiked matrix models'] For $H(x)=\frac12 \sum_{i=1}^N\lambda_i x_i^2$,
