{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.499574+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_89ec24de974472072ea857d5455be56d1c48ab5ea0fb001867443bf073c99756","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 ({\cite[Lemma 3.1) of arXiv:2608.28528, 'Strong solutions of SDEs with critical discontinuities in diffusion coefficients'] {RZ}}]

Let $U \subset \mathbb{R}^d$ be a bounded smooth domain. Let $\{F_n=F_n(x,\omega)\}$ be a sequence of random fields in $L^2(U \times \Omega, dx \times \mathbf{P})$. 
