{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.576677+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8a0c49130df72559c7f22a8185d260823f4fc82c840439cee6cef7cb98cb971c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-sup  S_k -001 of arXiv:2412.08932, 'Gaussian heat kernel asymptotics for conditioned random walks'] There exists a constant $c > 0$ such that, 
