{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.673281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8a839ea2409f93b0331c414d9bab59684569ff9823a565030d9763183296a5bd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2609.02175, '2609.02175'] Let $V_j(x)=v_j(|x|)$, $j=1,2$, satisfy the short-range condition
