\item  the fact that the point $(s,h)$ is an intersection of two radial birds, implies that $\left\{(s,h)\in \Lcal^{(k)}_e\right\}= \left\{\Hcal\left(\overline{U^s_h}\right)=k+1\right\}$.
\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

