{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.716639+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8aee85ef14b599941f65974cda4fba1be74426f6609d0aadf304e1c002202a06","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition EM:d2 of arXiv:2604.16206, 'Extrapolation of max--stable random fields with Fr\'echet marginals'] Let $(X_1,X_2)$ be a simple max-stable random vector. Then for $\sigma_1,\sigma_2>0$ we have
