{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.538958+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8aeedd68d6e6e7e968bceb4111c4d3bb2449632a34d85d9b3061f9a4a6bae585","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 91 of arXiv:2609.01389, 'K-stability and birational rigidity of Fano 3-fold weighted complete intersections'] The defining polynomials of $X$ can be written as
