{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.350501+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8af28cbce2ebccfe08e4cceb0c1485ef48a1838941047fa2d5ef29d2f4df8bb3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 2 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] For a set $S \sse \cH$ and a dimer $\fd$, we write $\fd \sim S$ if $\fd$ shares a neighbor with a vertex in $S$.
