{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.711356+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b06448bc7475abfe4425a279eb391484dc29480b8864e0a586c67d354a55bf9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma EthV12 of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] [FSmap] 
