{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.968108+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b1802265f700b0cc6dcd4ed2952505634646562652de180a7db6a7ca406af55","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 27 of arXiv:2608.12291, 'When should one stop the most exciting game?\\ {\tiny Sequential Inference for win-marting'] The value function $V_T$ satisfies
