{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.286586+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b4438a50dd6baa3826509f78a441528e4bfe930f51edbbc39497e00a89a4591","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem 4.7 of arXiv:2411.01847, 'Well-Posedness of Stochastic Chemotaxis System'] For all $m \in \mathbb{N}$ and $T \geq 0$, we have
