{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:06:39.258614+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8bbdb18acd9467ee19ed37660422fb75846daa68361c2f90612adf81c75e5bd3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:delaybounds of arXiv:2607.08914, 'Linear spreading speed in non-monotone population models'] There are constants $C,c \in (0,\infty)$
  such that:
  \begin{enumerate}
