{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:33:21.479417+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c227c471185404cb39e4c1eb420c6f2c6261dff707c2bf52cbe5bb5d1224776","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Def Def_convexity of arXiv:2606.22183, 'Expected loss of quasi-arithmetic means of exchangeable random variables'] Let $I\subseteq \mathbb{R}$ be a nondegenerate interval.
