\mathscr{H}^{[m],0} & = \bigg\{f \in \mathscr{H}^{[m]} \quad \bigg| \quad \forall h \in [H] \quad \oint_{\gamma_h} \frac{\dd z}{2\ii\pi}\, f(z) = 0 \bigg\}.
