{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.883159+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d06277f1ab8f6b70b825ed8f5a9caeeff5d7be9be6688306ebcf26d72cda511","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 of arXiv:2609.02500, '2609.02500'] If $\gamma_q>0$, then $D_q$ is an effective $\Q$-divisor satisfying $D_q\sim_{\Q} H$, and 
