{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.013616+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d1ed98e29845619ad4336ddf5f07080fde861bd348b187a274a2ef0d49c7bd4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 68 of arXiv:2609.02850, 'Canonical-row Chern flow on Bott--Samelson towers:\\ realizable-volume models for Schubert'] For every $0\le k\le r_w$,
