{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.657357+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d275d5036b624a6c02261a89d6306526a0c0ed8d14d6d8fa02f0bc9183658be","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 20 of arXiv:2608.30763, 'Ultracontractivity of heat semigroups with non-local Robin boundary conditions via two-sid'] We define the operator associated with the form $\tilde{a}(A,B)$ as follows.
