{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.845747+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d63839797e835d24230adf623c12509e9613b197384dddbd821e48bbc444ece","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:compact.embed of arXiv:2607.07598, 'Universal Central Limit Theorem for non-exchangeable interacting diffusions'] Let $\ell\ge 1$ and $M>0$. Define
