{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.440386+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d7aeef1113300f2f7fc2924e1094978de4ffdec0ffb6fc40b8bf796346210b6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma3 of arXiv:2509.04155, 'An Approach to Sub-Gaussian Heat Kernel Estimates via Analysis on Metric Spaces'] Let $p \geq 1$ and $(\mathcal{F}_p,\Gamma_p,\Psi)$ be a $p$-energy structure.
