{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.674138+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d8a4787c42c095f347d9b60e8c459f93a6104cab65f9ab233d81ac54dd3b070","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 31 of arXiv:2608.09700, 'A general paracontrolled ansatz for singular SPDEs'] For any tree $\tau\in T\sqcup T^+$ and $|n|>|\tau|$, we have 
