{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:59:45.466042+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d8b7f536684bdcf113b2163fb16da9f32df125bc0b9200d9bb43565a35a2bed","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_beta of arXiv:2411.16572, 'Optimal decay of eigenvector overlap for non-Hermitian random matrices'] Fix any $|z_i|< 10$ and $0< |\eta_i|<10~(i=1,2)$. On the imaginary axis, both the product $\beta_+\beta_-$ and sum $\beta_++\beta_-$ are positive and
	\begin{align}
		 & 0< \beta_+\beta_- \sim \widehat\gamma= |z_1-z_2|^2 +\rho_1 |\eta_1|+ \rho_2 |\eta_2|+\Big(\frac{\eta_1}{\rho_1}\Big)^2+\Big(\frac{\eta_2}{\rho_2}\Big)^2,\\
		 & 0<\beta_++\beta_- \sim |z_1-z_2|^2+\rho_1^2 +\rho_2^2+ \frac{|\eta_1|}{\rho_1} + \frac{|\eta_2|}{\rho_2}.
	\end{align}
Furthermore, $\beta_++\beta_--\beta_+\beta_-$ is also postive and
	\begin{align}
		0< \beta_++\beta_--\beta_+\beta_- \sim  \rho_1^2 +\rho_2^2+ \frac{\eta_1}{\rho_1} + \frac{\eta_2}{\rho_2}.
	\end{align}
Morover, $\beta_+-\beta_-$ is either real-valued or purely imaginary and
	\begin{align}
		0<\mathrm{Re}\,(\beta_+-\beta_-) \lesssim \rho_1\rho_2, \qquad 0<\mathrm{Im}\,(\beta_+-\beta_-) \lesssim |z_1-z_2|.
	\end{align}
Finally, we have
\begin{align}
	\min\{|\beta_\pm |\} \gtrsim \gamma= \frac{|z_1-z_2|^2 +\rho_1 |\eta_1|+ \rho_2 |\eta_2|+\Big(\frac{\eta_1}{\rho_1}\Big)^2+\Big(\frac{\eta_2}{\rho_2}\Big)^2}{ |z_1-z_2|+\rho_1^2 + \frac{|\eta_1|}{\rho_1}+\rho_2^2+\frac{|\eta_2|}{\rho_2} }.
\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.894628+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d8e12ae790995bd27ca2b8e7956e88bfbf5f4025a37c6bde609028404fcdd78","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop biliearesti of arXiv:2606.31155, 'The well-posedness of stochastic Korteweg--de Vries equations revisited'] Let $3/8<b<1/2$, $0<T<1$. Then for $\varepsilon<2b-3/4$, we have 
