\end{equs} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.652834+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d97b2fd99a5aba16987ba3262cbcae8f47e0d6c923084dfa3b3f35ee3eed4fd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 36 of arXiv:2609.01389, 'K-stability and birational rigidity of Fano 3-fold weighted complete intersections'] The defining polynomials of $X$ can be written as
