        \abs[\big]{\tfrac{\slowVar(y)}{\slowVar(x)}}
        \le A \max\set[\Big]{\bigl(\tfrac{y}{x}\bigr)^\epsilon, \bigl(\tfrac{y}{x}\bigr)^{-\epsilon}}
