{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.497627+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8de8b9cd37e03bc5611f6fa6651538769214c71238133302aecd04c04be58697","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 16 of arXiv:2608.30578, 'Compactly Supported Solutions near a Nehari Critical Value'] Assume that $0<\alpha<1$, $m\in L^\infty(\Omega)$, and
