{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:31.998725+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8df056b5d81a43abc5109863cc62314a0faca7f84882dc08e943cfbeb0d373d1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 (Barrier is not crossed a second time) of arXiv:2512.02661, 'Worst-case mixing estimates for Brownian motion with semipermeable barriers'] Adopt the notion and assumptions of Lemma \ref{lem: W_si_nice} and assume that the event from \eqref{eq:SlowIce} occurs.
