{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.024349+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8eab60bfbbd075496ea422b48571db3cde72b374a55435f62a7a748b58e5fa15","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma bound-gradient of arXiv:2609.03858, 'High-Dimensional Learning Dynamics of \\ Attention-Indexed Models'] Fix a constant $C_*>0$. Suppose that, at step $n$,
