{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:23:58.622311+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8ee06dd489e8b2964044278eb91422e4a70265698f47a10adf35e63428679d0e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 187 (The $\nullhyparg{u}$-tangent elliptic-hyperbolic characteristic current) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Let $\SigmatTan$ be a $\Sigma_t$-tangent vectorfield.
