{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.659652+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f1da7395e57a971ccbcd743f67884f3c75bcc43d787210a588067fa840256ed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Bernstein of arXiv:2604.07497, 'The Three-Dimensional Stochastic EMHD System: Local Well-Posedness and Maximal Pathwise So'] (Bernstein's inequality) 
