{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.359418+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f3df5508403114df343478060ef0660cd0af80f19a8974c19ac9d9c4180f587","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 22 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] Assume \eqref{H1} and \eqref{eq:3rd}. For any $\delta>0$ and $m\ge 1$, uniformly for $\delta n \le s \le h(q_n)-\delta n$, we have:
