{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.096114+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f5aa5ca23769c03247748cf70d0cf3ee8bab26a462198b5af53ae1576ca3c00","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 28 of arXiv:2608.19976, 'Random valuations'] Let $\Phi:\Kd\to\R$ be a square-integrable stochastic process such
