		(1 - \rho(G))^2 \cdot \left| \overline{A} \right| - ( | \partial_{\mathrm{ext}} A| - |B|).
	\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.747859+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f616248ae9b86bc99a38b2d249f4f8a6e1c0c7634d516691b1fce7ddfb09818","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2608.29872, 'Local Laws and Outlier Eigenvalues for Spiked Separable Covariance Matrices'] For each fixed $r\in \mathbb{N}$, we have
