{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:48:43.601313+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f8ac3021993389162807b3450eb1ce5eccf919d6d4769fb41082e649d539e7d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 69 of arXiv:2608.07239, 'Unified framework for asymptotically uniform iterative construction of generalised random '] For $\lambda\geq1$, in $A(\lambda)$, we have
