			\Sigma^{(2)}\leq\tfrac{2\lambda\log\log\alpha}{5\log\alpha}+O\left(\tfrac{\lambda}{\log\alpha}\right)&&\text{if}\ \lambda=O\left(\tfrac{\alpha}{M(\log\alpha)^2}\right).
