{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.157594+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8ffb8900d7751feb56865a6691bd49a33d12acf8b6f1058b4baddc307599cf69","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 2 (Profile seminorm) of arXiv:2609.01589, 'Uniform stability of expanding simple waves for Euler--Poisson--Boltzmann: a singular comp'] For fixed $0\le t_0<T$ and a planar coefficient $f=f(t,x_1)$, set
