{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.089739+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_900437445e653e813dc14b1fc5bd653acf9000741040c789022c3cb90b78258d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition e-hull of arXiv:2412.08400, '\vspace{-1.0cm} Characterization of Exponential Families of \\ Lumpable Stochastic Matrice'] {wolfer2021information}}]

Let $\mathcal{V}$ be a sub-family of $\mathcal{W}(\mathcal{Y}, \mathcal{E})$.
