{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:19:47.203433+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_90234794664a9db2a069f85fcd5c1cba93c4e7fa1d64cb24919a2cb3a130f4e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem main_quasi:existence of arXiv:2512.06640, 'Existence and sharpness of the phase transition for the frog model on transitive graphs'] Let $G = (V, E)$ be a quasi-transitive graph. Then, 
