{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.715773+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_902524420851684b5d176ca43b1afe9e22cc6975725429d1e2ecf074ea82826b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 (Tensor-coordinate realization of the selected class) of arXiv:2608.06393, 'Intrinsic Tangential Hadamard Differentiability of Rough-BSDE Solution Maps'] The map
\begin{equation}
 \Psi_{\mathbf x}:
