{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:52:57.724139+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_90b0b6330b03b6835b12bac86415549e878a6c71328a67ad0e3e94a322e0d8d7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 39 (Scaling law for Nesterov) of arXiv:2609.02728, 'Momentum in large-batch training: Polyak enlarges the critical batch size, Nesterov improv'] \normalfont
Assume \(\eta<1\) and \(k\gtrsim\max(\eta^{-1}_\rho,(1-\rho)^{-1})\). Then
