{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.321035+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91211e43723bcf575dac8a8c43dbbe52bae8e700d1b8f252741a0b26b022f9ec","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:SRW of arXiv:2601.10624, 'Source localisation in simple random walks'] For any infinite vertex-transitive strongly transient graph $\mathbb{H}$ of finite degree,
