{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.633095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9122b8fcfc62b19164f26a8f7593565d8317bfa9c8923cd03c95a228c11a14f7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 (Helical direction and angle reconstruction) of arXiv:2609.00673, '2609.00673'] Under the hypotheses of the theorem,
