{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:36:12.190538+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_912672c64cb39da261dda905537ce6c566ba8015a5649143b8797779740b99e3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 (Monotone truncation) of arXiv:2609.03916, 'Halfspace Theorems for Anisotropic Minimal Surfaces and Perimeter Minimizers'] Let $U\subset\R^{n+1}$ be open, let
