{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.073299+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_912ab9c7b1e1d13f3816652fa7603e09ba7e664064f1e30cceb4ffca822447c6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l.jump_formula of arXiv:2411.14105, 'Simultaneous replica-symmetry breaking \\ for vector spin glasses'] Under~(i.setting of the paper), further assume that the decomposition is canonical and fix $X_0=0$.
