{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:31.002785+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9134f08c5897bf7b96e5f3e74ef2cae393fa0bd853db97c85f4a5294667d1f92","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 63 (Discontinuity of exact support projectors) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] Let $e,h$ be orthonormal, put $Z=I_1(h)$, and let $Y_n=I_n(y_n)$ be normalized with
