{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.052767+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_919217671d4be6f840da4e8da67e6824b4a7377365997f39787a9dc8939c9558","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:shellblocks of arXiv:2608.30888, 'Three-term asymptotics for discrete\\ Hardy--Rellich constants in high dimension'] For every fixed $\ell$, as $N\to\infty$,
\begin{align}
