 (\mathcal J_N+\mathcal B_N)+O_\ell(N^{\ell-2}),
 \\
 P_1K_{\ell,N}Q_1
 &=-\ell(2N)^{\ell-1}2^{\ell/2}C_N+T_{\ell,N},
