{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.768663+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91995686d489366f1571759d6e39d2389937c722d46ad955a0ad1516c7afa26d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2609.02225, '\textbf{The direct moving plane method for weak solutions of the fractional $p$-Laplacian}'] Let \(q>0\), and set
\[
