{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.363472+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91c51e474cbe2f4d7d1a53ece8e94c568941e01694c50b3cf749597d444e5673","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:estimation of arXiv:2606.02472, 'Correlated uniform attachment trees'] There exists an estimator 
