{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.556037+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_91f387389aa54701b42a7064d28ae89a924b8faf071e09a855e6d7ca6f6c1cbf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2609.01826, 'An extension theory for fully fractional Schr\"odinger equations with memory'] Let $0<s<1$ and set $a=1-2s\in(-1,1)$. Assume that
