    \end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:30:14.226436+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9206cf386411affc8448b5ac68f44e5d26b5a8592c8d0c4e897d2e4af6d0d0ad","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem element estimates bfE-n-R-2 of arXiv:2608.23156, 'Disc counting statistics of the real Ginibre ensemble'] Under the assumptions of Lemma~(lem: element estimates bfM-n-R of the paper), we have as $N\to\infty$ that
