{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:02.013901+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_920c11efe99542b66aaba9a1171578c9e35bf19e5be52b1a19a01877bd13264f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LEM:part of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Let $Q\in \mathbb{Z}$ with $|Q|=k$. Then we have 
