where $x!!$ is the double factorial function (the product of $x$ and only every other positive integer less than $x;$ the positive integers with the same parity as $x.$) (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.013283+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_923513fc07bf9056f338ad08c5ebc209ba02f9c3d4a8ce8edc9784715da2c10d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 62 of arXiv:2609.02850, 'Canonical-row Chern flow on Bott--Samelson towers:\\ realizable-volume models for Schubert'] Let $\mathcal A_\alpha$ be the Demazure atom.  Then
