{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.646537+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9285f3db4264fbdbcb725b0709abbf0159cc65489705dbdd80a0b5402056cb84","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 102 (Annealed divisor spectrum and quenched zero density) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] Fix $t>0$ and assume
