{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:30:28.827120+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_929d3337e426d413b4128a68434a1b8c4336c855f13437acefccf0935a9cd737","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2609.02105, 'Contact fundamental forms and \\ adjoint varieties'] For  $v_1,\ldots,v_N\in\fh_1$, put
