{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.884845+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_92d09a49bdb3e4a4d129c45fd48d1e7ef1533baeea85a5b2e98e56594ccbc336","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 13 of arXiv:2506.11918, 'Central limit theorems for the Euler characteristic in the Random Connection Model for hig'] [CLT for increasing observation window] 
