{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:41:03.269739+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9325a9c79eb5c467ebb564cfbf45a23b3a7143dd59e93d9bee2bf9d177ae77f3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mylem Lem_Moments_2 of arXiv:2411.08430, 'The Restricted Isometry Property of Block Diagonal Matrices Generated by $\varphi$-Sub-Gau'] Assume that a random variable $\xi$ satisfies for $p\ge p_{0}$
