{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.678652+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9325dc3bda7d10539d1ae06c2cc455263f8ee51dba1f56d48941c0e6cf43d41f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem excursionpartition of arXiv:2411.12149, 'Airy limit for $\beta$-additions through Dunkl operators'] For $H\in \mathbb{Z}_{\ge 0}$, $L\in \mathbb{Z}_{\ge 1}$, the partition function for the walk bridges with length $L$ from $H$ to $0$ is 
