{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.211583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_939cfcc641a90845cbceab8971e7cbe4403d14c36f022a707b016d302a08077f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm matrix-sharpness of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] Fix integers $r_{\star}\ge1$ and $k\ge2$.
