{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.906034+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_93c7d85dd3592eb81592480fa96c21b491c627bd42ccfa3cb9c8e01d879d51d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Muirhead, Rivera, Severo of arXiv:2411.11429, 'Functional Central Limit Theorem for topological functionals of Gaussian critical points'] Assume Assumption (ass:gaussian-intro of the paper) holds. Then, Assumption (ass:perco of the paper) holds in the following cases:\begin{itemize}
