{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.693714+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_93e0fcca4a0f9ac67c410985485550b7a23d6cd7a0ee8d5705ef438b53f68fdf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 16 of arXiv:2609.02193, 'State-law dynamics of McKean-Vlasov stochastic reaction-diffusion equations on $\mathbb R^'] For every $\epsilon\in[0,\epsilon_0]$, the map
	\begin{align}
		\Phi^\epsilon(t,\omega)(x,\mu)
