{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.658879+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_940bc257d9102e2a4c7b2c8513dd16b883c3ac66c7d57672171d2026113c6f29","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2608.09700, 'A general paracontrolled ansatz for singular SPDEs'] The solution $ u_{\eps}$ of the regularised equation
