{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:26:26.799118+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94585549c70ed3263d8ef8a51192f1d248c057ec287e0ba1842f0c125b66f4e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:conditional-expectations-next-day of arXiv:2608.06159, 'Majority Dynamics on Resampled Sparse Erd\H{o}s--R\'enyi Graphs:\\[0.5ex] Gaussian Winner '] For all \(t \geq 0\), the conditional expectations of the camp sizes on the next day can be expressed as
