{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:24:20.994275+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94bae9a6ec07c15aaa5e365bdeb884682ddca61901ab24fb952a6337033da4c8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:cesaro_ests of arXiv:2509.03048, 'Elephant random walks on infinite Cayley trees'] Let $\alpha \ge 0$ and $\beta > 0$. We have
