{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:48:45.317560+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94da6278bffdc374b762bea165d4ff43ee7d14fdd126a248934c23a7e7e5d487","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:503 of arXiv:2411.14921, 'A boundary Harnack principle and its application to analyticity of 3D Brownian intersectio'] \textnormal{(i) (Cylinder vs Cylinder)}
