\end{equation}
where the infimum runs over all neighbourhoods of $\phi$.

Similarly, the \textbf{lower AP entropy of $\phi$ along $\bspi$} is the quantity
\begin{equation}
\ul{\rmh}^\ann_{\bspi}(\phi) := \inf_O \liminf_{n\to\infty} \frac{1}{d_n}\log \bbE\frac{\vol_{2kd_n}\X(\pi_n,O)}{v(d_n)^k},
\end{equation}
where the infimum runs over all neighbourhoods of $\phi$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:07.033729+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94ef2b86e05b9028ba985b96f762926518d3eaf1864accf4bc4bc65d797a1f8c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:ZIMfast2 of arXiv:2607.29409, 'The Zombie Infection Model'] Consider the ZIM on $K_{N}$ with $\lambda >1$ and initially
