{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:04:59.425708+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94fa2b52c9a010422241f22aa5acb6d55b8bf4bf624ec643f48a4756f672885c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma DensityQuotient of arXiv:2605.18744, 'Lattice random-field Widom--Rowlinson models'] Let $o\in\Lambda\Subset\mathbb{Z}^d$, $\omega \in \Omega^+_\Lambda$ with $\omega_o\neq 1$, and $\zeta\in \mathbb{R}^{\Lambda}$. Then, 
