W_{d^N}(\mu^{\bigotimes N}_t, \mu_t^N) \leq C_1 e^{-\lambda t}W_{d^N}(\mu^{\bigotimes N}_0, (\mu_0^N)^{\bigotimes N}) + C_2 N^{-1/2},
