{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.871264+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9648647f96f3dbb6aca8a2e42ec19e6d34a39fbed07acbffb1a0a64a659edb0c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma initial of arXiv:2512.19897, 'On the convoy of the ASEP speed process'] Given $d\left(0\right) = 2$, let $\pi_k$ denote the conditional distribution of $Q_1$. Then $\pi_k$ satisfies the recurrence
