 \sum_{\underline{\mathcal{B}}\in {\mathcal P}_{\underline{b}}} \prod_{j=1}^4 C_{\mathcal{B}_j,\mathcal{B}_{9-j}}^2 =\binom{n}{b_1,b_2,b_3,b_4} \sum_{\mathcal{A}\subset [\![2n ]\!],\, |\mathcal{A}|=n} C_{\mathcal{A},\mathcal{A}'}^2.
