Moreover, if
$\widetilde{\Sigmab}_j = \widetilde{\Lambdab}_j\widetilde{\Lambdab}_j^\star + \widetilde{\Psib}_j$, then $\widetilde{\Sigmab}_d\otimes\cdots\otimes \widetilde{\Sigmab}_1 = \Sigmab_d\otimes\cdots\otimes\Sigmab_1$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

