{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.893105+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9893daaa61dae3e9aef23a0855c70a1a577da551f26e3da61f5febbef6fe5750","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:Janson of arXiv:2606.30475, 'Ancestries in random $d$-DAGs'] {Jan2023}}]
 Let $d\geq 2$. Then, as $n\to\infty$, both in distribution and for all moments,
 \begin{equation}
