{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.639244+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98994e9afc4b7bf4dd8fbed88d8ba148f396a0f9927f4e12c42ff72a6aee8d69","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 ({\cite[Proposition 4.6) of arXiv:2605.31344, 'Subcritical sharpness for real-valued spin models'] {well_behaved}}]

