{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.973578+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98d843fccf09eae09dee0ec61d14a8c32fa45aa081bdfa464229072cc99aa4da","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi def:nonstandard_LR_coefs of arXiv:2412.05999, 'Non-Archimedean GUE corners and Hecke modules'] \begin{enumerate}
