{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-09T06:55:03+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98fb8a8542e7a9f450477ec55bf960ea67c9ac6a95d7577d6bb2937606628cc2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Kac, Pleijel) of arXiv:2507.06186, '2507.06186'] If $\partial D$ is sufficiently regular (e.g., smooth), then
