{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.626402+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_995e351e51976a85bfd0bccc60aeb40c0c299d60f6d65814110b0889b0d66ae9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:boundaryboxes of arXiv:2609.01825, 'On everywhere locally soluble varieties \\ in families over toric bases'] Let $\vec W = (\log (B/X_1), \dots, \log (B/X_k))$ as in the previous lemma, $\vec U_{\!\pm}$ be defined as in (lem:decomposition into boxes of the paper), and $1< \theta \leq 2$. Let $\gamma > \max_{1\leq l\leq k} \sum_{i=1}^s \frac{\varpi_{li}}{\alpha_i}$. Then
