{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.431243+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_99a5604e904628087156492b5ef2d2014fab775b3dc1880989711f2a52763434","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:conditional.uniqueness of arXiv:2604.22453, 'Adapted Wasserstein Barycenters of Gaussian Processes'] Assume that, for every \(t\in[T]\), the local Bures--Wasserstein barycenter set
