{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.669354+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_99d1865f2f437c242f02aed8601993335ddf495d0076e12e6154cd0d25cdf385","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 (One-dimensional PF-ODE $=$ monotone rearrangement) of arXiv:2607.25685, 'Mimicking diffusion processes with differential equations'] Let $d=1$ and let $(p_t)$ solve \eqref{eq:fp} with $\int_{-\infty}^{x}p_t$ finite, and set
