{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.762862+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9a7ede24c70b9c4f24a971b7c879448e84e54e7bfaddf5188380be070e42876d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Proposition 8.5 of arXiv:2411.02541, 'The hockey-stick conjecture for\\ activated random walk'] \thlabel{prop:driven.dissipative.lower}
