{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.704260+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ad1ba9726c3f10b482c24969cc1b9eceb11334665d91f41784fcc14589c4acf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LEM: CL-est of arXiv:2411.07840, 'Central limit theorem for the focusing $Φ^4$-measure in the infinite volume limit'] There exists a constant $c>0$ such that 
