{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.326149+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9bd4133000ed7d0a2f7efc252c96bbdb4320693026503a25257e08142ea4dcd1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:EI of arXiv:2601.10624, 'Source localisation in simple random walks'] For each $d \geqslant 5$, $\mathbb{E}[J]$ is finite. Moreover, we have
