		\P(\tau(a)<1)^{1/2} \\
	&\le L^{O(1)}
	\bE_a [\P(\tau(a)<1)^{1/2}]
	\le L^{O(1)} \Big( \bE_a\P(\tau(a)<1)\Big)^{1/2}
	\stackrel{\eqref{e:truncation.K.stopping.time.small.prob}}{\le}
	o_{\trK}(1)\,.
	\end{align*}
Recall again the coupling of $X(1)$ with $Z\sim\mu$. Under this coupling, let $Z(a)$ denote the random variable $Z$ conditioned on the index $a\in[M]$. We then bound
