{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:06:07.089288+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c2570fdcf82fb91912ba0ac5616c6c32119a747077456ced78a6c2b0c482703","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi 11 of arXiv:2608.28148, 'Flows and homotopies of Banach Lie algebroids'] ${}$
