{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.863184+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c7ebe6610c2587a15a9ae572474a97228d026f987a4c23032d80f6e3025605e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2506.10817, 'On the Weak Error for Local Stochastic Volatility Models'] Let $h,\gamma,\lambda>0$ and  $T>0$ such that $n\coloneqq T/h\in\mathbb{N}$. Assume that there is a recurrence relation of the form 
