{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.640650+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c82ecb607ad63602b4318ee626e6adc9acaf4beff36d09c1e426d3568590197","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 19 of arXiv:2605.23529, 'Generalized Bessel-Dunkl diffusions'] For every $i=1,\ldots,N$ the processes $\eAi{M}$ are semi-martingales described by
