  &+2\anbRi\ab\eabBi{M-2}k_\beta(x)-2\sum_{\beta\notin\Ri}\sum_{\aRi}\frac{\left<\alpha,\sigma_\beta(\alpha)\right>}{|\beta|^2}\easBi{M-2}{\sigma_\beta(\alpha)}k_\beta(x)\/.
