{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.875724+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c8a70abe84efb9f80eca0bb3445c4407b4841d8541a415862bbc363dfd7494b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:slow_mixing_formal of arXiv:2605.10911, 'The stochastic block model has the overlap graph property for modularity'] Consider the MCMC initiated at the Gibbs distribution conditioned on being in $\mathcal{E}_{\rm far}$. Namely, suppose
