{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.472884+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c9dc91f7e65bf9f3dd7d087871ca20ea68a170ae06f4ecf24689b6d6533897e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:Haar-entry-tail of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[lemma]{lem:Haar-incoherent}
