{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.164572+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9cb8c0ade6a8d311741046d81b74e03b535396cf4af51c522d8407f604088868","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma covariance DMP decomp of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] Let $T \geq 0$. Then
