{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:15:09.114338+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9dec5de3cde0182ea7e431a510cbbac922fa29e5a1b3eb14e9cfdc4823a470e1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Cumulant expansion for epsilon cumulants of arXiv:2411.11341, 'Ultra high order cumulants and quantitative CLT for polynomials in Random Matrices'] Let $\mathcal{X}\sim GUE$. For any $r\geq 1$ the following holds
