{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.128438+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9df9cdc1b492ad14b67f00efe9a1bdc26927a8a6afecb6c679ac7e83ce34c900","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition pr:Fdim of arXiv:2510.09818, 'On the Fourier dimension of fractional Brownian graphs'] [LL25].
