    &+\lambda f(0,{\lambda^o}) \bar{G}_{\ell}(n+1, (A-\lambda) \textrm{-}),
  \end{split}

\end{equation}
  where  $G_{\ell}(n, \cdot)$ is the distribution function defined in (equation e:Gell of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

