{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.624236+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0c044e7693253d74a2cd4bf3946e320a66d65f3c324656f54813049ffb38f95","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 84 (Native valuation exchange and flag reconstruction) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] For every nonzero $q\in M_{\lambda,n}^*$,
