{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:30:07.917304+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0c2df36d0d01be262e22289d3a3cca74aca55ae15fba44641c62f272b01c64f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_lozenge of arXiv:2608.09105, 'Longest convex chains with i.i.d.\ points'] Let $\lozenge\subset\mathbb{R}^2$ be a parallelogram.
