{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.996776+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0e11fdc5f0d589723092ff68282e00aee4b52e8fbf2843e5ddcdbc53b8d6a02","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 of arXiv:2609.03403, 'Hyperpositive functions, sector bounded functions and a trace formula'] In the setting and notation of the preceding paragraph, $M_S$ is a contraction if and only if the kernel
