{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.595730+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0f5a438393c07c506f4246f8983aad501f9eb50cd1f25550c849465c4a9ab10","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2607.07022, 'Coordinate-wise Elephant Random Walk'] There exists $C_f<\infty$ such that
