Define the quantities
\begin{align*}
&\beta_1^{(\xi)}  :=|\nu_{\xi}|(\Xi),  \qquad \beta_2  :=\int_{\Xi} \beta_1^{(\xi)}|\mu|(\mathrm{d} \xi), 
\qquad \beta_2^{(\xi)}  :=\int_{\Xi} \beta_1^{(\eta)}|\nu_{\xi}|(\mathrm{d} \eta), \\
