with probability $\geq 1-o(1)$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.870629+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1ba9607b83f7599f98801934b5bc992919f5115e2858f071014b2ff48ceb41b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2609.02064, 'Coalescence and fluctuations of O'Connell--Yor polymers\\ via the free-energy correlation '] Fix $n\in\Z_{>0}$, $\al\in\R$, $\be>0$, and
