{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.361596+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1f3b31011e175d936e94196a65f2fcadbb6b8412c5566260824a5750fce59bb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:random-entropy of arXiv:2607.24705, 'Derangetropy Operators'] For every $f \in \mathcal{D}_{+}$ and every $n$,
