{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:19:42.668004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a217a4eefb1171b48b64d742f0455baf1b344e9a0de3705223f9e494242d29a4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2609.03556, 'An Effective SPDE Model for a Schr\"odinger Equation with a Fluctuating Magnetic Potential'] \label[lemma]{lemma_abstract_convergence_1}
