{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.511619+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a2a0620b82ee0ef16617f4579fba7c862f1e8d7d8cb401d08be9710c974686a8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary M-unconditional-under-An of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] \textbf{ }In every regime of Appendix~C in
