in the weak sense, together with the estimates 
\begin{equation}
\norm{X}_{L^2(\mu_0)}
 \leq\kappa_0^{-1/2}\norm{g}_{L^2(\mu_0)},\qquad
 \norm{Y}_{L^2(\mu_1)}=\norm{\nabla u}_{L^2(\mu_0)}
 \leq\kappa_1^{-1/2}\norm{g}_{L^2(\mu_0)}.
