{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:35:04.204165+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a36fb457e302a59bf571d464d310b7ff3f486e74ac5f1ca81b7071e1abb619fb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 22 (Dichotomy) of arXiv:2608.03575, '2608.03575'] Let $(G,\rho,\Theta)$ be an infinite, locally finite, simple, 
