\end{subequations}
all hold where in~(equation eq:existenceLambda of the paper)   $\Lambda_{+}$ 
 is a finite measure  on (the Borel subsets of)  $(0,1]$ and  $0 < x < 1$ is fixed.

Then $\left\{ \xi^{n,N}( \lfloor t/c_{N} \rfloor); t \ge 0 \right\}$ converges
