{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.589804+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a3d7c4e689915bb337af517a8e9000cd1c6eb1ad2a629ea75e25a65b5a1631c3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor uniquePelec of arXiv:2509.08659, 'Gap metrics for stationary point processes and quantitative convexity of the free energy'] For every $\beta>0$ the functional
