{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.901438+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a45d153255e52f0cacc2c9c029c224fd66e36b15a172cb8cf4e7955fdf03d550","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem SSK with external field \cite{ChenDeyPanchenko,Baiketal21,landon2020fluctuations} of arXiv:2510.26960, 'Free energy fluctuations in SK and related spin glass models: \\ A literature survey'] For fixed external field strength $h>0$, the free energy of SSK at any inverse temperature $\beta>0$ exhibits the following convergence in distribution as $N\to\infty$:
