{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.283981+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a5e43a09207477768a30fa45ae2b8bd98fc2ee1bb621d34042a89b95a68dae49","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2606.22940, 'From smooth to discontinuous kernels: a variance transfer principle for hyperuniform proce'] Let $ \M$ a weakly stationary random measure on $ \T.$
