{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.847151+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a5e4ece4ce21b63f9e42c0aa07942ab8cb858fd3702bada819582fc93ba73ee4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm.3 of arXiv:2512.19897, 'On the convoy of the ASEP speed process'] Consider TASEP ($q=0$). Conditionally on the event $U_0 = u$ with $x = \tfrac{1+u}{2}$, the asymptotic size of the convoy of particle $0$ satisfies
