{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:36:12.190136+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a6db59db9bb671035de2704554802af8f0a6c04820ed44a268e4b37bdc1912be","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Strict anisotropic logarithmic barrier) of arXiv:2609.03916, 'Halfspace Theorems for Anisotropic Minimal Surfaces and Perimeter Minimizers'] There exist constants $C_*=C_*(\Phi)>0$, $a_0=a_0(\Phi)>0$, and
