{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.164619+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a70a22a0e50e74cc85ad03dbcb336c3e1a731619c3948f609a3e7642784cd61a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] The tame Fréchet space bundles ${\mathbf{E}}_{00}$ and ${\mathbf{F}}_{00}$ defined in (Prop_BundleOfAdmissibleZModTwoZSpinors of the paper) decompose into
