  \end{equation*}
  with ${\mathbf{E}}_{00}^\pm$ denoting the \defined{universal bundle of admissible chiral $\mathbb{Z}/2\mathbb{Z}$ spinors}.
  The latter contains the open subset
  \begin{equation*}
