{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.707607+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7251748390ba255be0c6f5edbc1a6fcce08526932c29a355084158b0f0fc8ba","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:plateauGen of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~(thm:infvol2pt of the paper),
