{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:36:49.941409+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a73516a5c5b016f71d25f0ee6e2aa60d183bfcb8ee403186455975318ad6a336","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn smooth of arXiv:2609.01745, 'The Directional Localization Game on Graphs'] We say that a tree decomposition $(T, \mathcal{B})$ of width $k$ is \textit{smooth} if:
