{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.458390+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7440542a683aa6375c9e985016b890e4e4fb367fd4b8c6b62ed2f4af7af0e79","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 38 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Let $\gamma \geq 3/2$, $\lambda  \in (0, \; 1)$ and $0 \leq s \leq t \leq T$. For every $n \in \mathbb{N}_+$, it holds 
	\begin{align} 
