{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.782815+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a77cf19d0a03745701cbf767548bd430e5f346f53de271815e0eb3e29b364f5f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 9 of arXiv:2609.03054, 'The classes of bivariate Schur and Herglotz matrix-valued rational functions: realizations'] Let $G\in \mathbb C^{m \times n}(s,p)$ be a rational matrix valued  function. Then the following conditions are equivalent:
