{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.868264+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7b88a98c8ac0affcfae228ff3b3097f65f8f984b0952bb6e9dbe53fe738148b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 8 of arXiv:2609.02040, '\Large Quantum Landau Damping with Coulomb Repulsion in the Whole Space'] For every $t>0$, uniformly in $\h\in[0,1]$,
