{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:47.658267+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7f6cdeb22bb6f4a67591590747d892912a69937c1af385a17ba380fbb2566f5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 (Asymptotics of $d_j$) of arXiv:2605.08629, 'Moderate deviations for the Maki--Thompson rumour model'] Let $v_\infty = 1 - x_\infty$ and define
    \begin{align*}
        \kappa = 2 - 1/v_\infty,\quad
