{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:15:54.967406+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8295ede1c81a0a68b7cc50884e3c828682dad554d1a1eae6edde94ea665bef2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:iel-frames of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] {artemov_intuitionistic_2016}}] 
