{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.952015+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a82df6916d21c1e3bfd2eb773e6a248ea3f78452d862a3d1aaec1cc008fcb58a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2604.05234, 'Quantitative propagation of chaos and universality for asymmetric Langevin spin glass dyna'] For all $\bfJ \in \R^{N\times N}$, the measure $P_t(\bfJ)$ satisfies the covariance bound 
