\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.008809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8332b186c098a6a3c34a3c7763d7d6ed6c50ef2d8bcfb12d6919ec9bce7f745","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 16 of arXiv:2609.02808, 'Minimizers of Laplace eigenvalues under a lower curvature bound'] Suppose $\varphi\colon[0,D]\to[0,\infty)$ is continuous, positive on $(0,D)$, and satisfies 
