{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.189734+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a83b28b475c0ec0904d919f5eac0240e74c4b26dc662d53c5d0d9150ed36017b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2604.19200, 'Stochastic $\Sigma$-convergence in Orlicz setting and Applications'] \cite{nnang2014deterministic}
