{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.645811+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8450e7f429b3e76deb4e2fc69b610db9bd439b18b513608b65894e998b7a4b5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 (TV bound via the shifted construction) of arXiv:2605.24937, '2605.24937'] Assume~\eqref{eq:reg-framework} and~\eqref{eq:tv-local-error}, and let
