{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.692103+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8eeed5ee0e7e86ed3e1308ba252f2b75e5dd51972359d9cb525c175a6f2cf0f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition eq:Lower_action of arXiv:2510.21186, 'Weingarten Calculus with Virtual Isometries'] Let $k$ and $n$ be positive integers such that $k \le n$.
