{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.321534+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8f72df0a99ea5ee85b0a0f0a74159f8eaceaf0ce3a880a5ce3cef7d1aa5780a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 17 (Finite-horizon stability and modulus) of arXiv:2608.30261, 'Estimating Population-Risk Curves Along Nonconvex Gradient Flows from the Training Sample'] \label[proposition]{prop:gf-stability}
