{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:02:17.908511+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa086e5f81d90f0205af1c0f1801fde26dd77bf509d1f37d5ffb47f2947ad5b8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Compact injections local versions. of arXiv:2602.08591, 'The Yang--Mills measure on compact surfaces as a \\ universal scaling limit of lattice gau'] Let $\alpha\in (\frac{1}{3},\frac{1}{2})$. 
