{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.641944+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa6dc0748832d596caba5c764cf177a8e91020ee4d2b48e293e8bf6b6325b250","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 38 of arXiv:2605.23529, 'Generalized Bessel-Dunkl diffusions'] Let $\abQ$ and $\delta\in R_+$ such that $|\delta|^2=2$. Then 
