{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:01:48.560669+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aaec0d740f68337a0daff3a1ac7b6e05de7b5dfc183c3dd7f63319e15286214e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:sig_bound of arXiv:2606.29622, 'Affine Structure of the Brownian Signature'] Let $X = (X_t)_{t \in [0, T]}$ be a continuous semimartingale and let $\sigXhat[]$ denote its time-augmented signature. Then, for any word ${\color{NavyBlue}{\mathbf{v}}} \in V\,$, there exists a constant $C_{{\color{NavyBlue}{\mathbf{v}}}, T} \geq 0\,$, such that
