{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.413947+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab12c9b50e6c8682bc395c98dda48ad50f65b917e4883bc04328cd45e73ff401","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 74 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Let $\mathcal A_\eps\subseteq \W_\N$ denote the set of configurations such that
