{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.595298+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab15afb26cdbfb0514564d88a991ecbd05701748a045030b329ff67650c1cb4e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-5.6 of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] Let~$\beta=\beta_\text{\rm c}$  and suppose that the sequence $\{\fraktura d_j\}_{j\ge0}$ from Assumption~(ass-1 of the paper) obeys $\sum_{j\ge1}\fraktura d_j\log(j)<\infty$.  Then
