{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.610121+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab3519c2b2f4598ad452e95a3a5e769c3caf8ceca14da3a696809c9efa4affef","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (\cite{Meurant,Usmani}) of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Let $\ma{M}$ be an $n\times n$ tridiagonal matrix satisfying the assumptions above.
