{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.601474+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aba202d1d74aee926d2d0fbf0136b61318b83e1aa43c294575ddd8293786354b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 27 (Gaussian transportation) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] \label[lemma]{lem:gp-transport}
