{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:47.660946+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac5bcd8c5eb8322ea68c201fbd1e8e5ba00f7333abf4ce648051a1b28d26c740","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 31 of arXiv:2605.08844, 'Signature Kernel and Schwinger-Dyson Kernel Equations as Two-Parameter Rough Differential '] The equation
