{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.043777+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac68e70f33a96a482f973dee85826e7eb1c720083d20af6f998bbdc834cc896f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2606.31936, 'Coupling and Maximal Inequalities for Graph-Dependent Empirical Processes'] For any $g \in \mathcal F$ and any block $B \subseteq N_{n}$, 
	\begin{align*}
