{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.859236+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ad73c4bec967347d7b7598e054e9102fc3e4aa43187bd918334cd8dd6eb365c7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 2 of arXiv:2608.21090, 'Ornstein--Uhlenbeck process conditioned to have restricted $L_2$-norm'] Let $0<\theta<\frac{1}{2\gamma}$. Then, as $T\to\infty$,
