{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:53:00.822370+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ada579d71db9e69957ba4b52ff39d8cea3927d452bee06346abc4ae229dc91f6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Def: grafting of arXiv:2607.18635, 'Remainders of generalised Taylor expansions and a priori bounds for rough differential equ'] For $\tau\in{\mathcal T}, w\in{\mathcal F}$ we recursively define the grafting of trees in $\mathcal{H}$ as
