{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.019049+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_adbb659298ed18654b5bd9d40d2718a764eff09e2db6bc7a1c73638d877e31ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:It_asymp-2 of arXiv:2605.15545, 'Crossover from subcritical to critical decay: \\ random walk, self-avoiding walk, percolat'] Let $d \ge 1$, $\varepsilon \in (0,1] $, and denote
