{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.384506+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae1888a3db5c7e8e7a03fe24caa37c047f7cabe4ad8e11d79a1acdd11fcca106","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 9 of arXiv:2609.03248, 'Connections between colored restricted $b$-ary and ordinary partitions'] We have the generating function
