{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:31.967778+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae8f975248c15dbce188f57c3f4dc6eb518de36171e43b1237c0cfb4ecd89f65","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2606.09904, 'Non-explosion principles for branched rough differential equations with unbounded coeffici'] For any \(f \in \CF_{N - 1}\), we have the estimate
  \begin{equation}
    \begin{split}
