{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.304051+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aef86306c7d8d322da26288c1da399c7a7d6c45b50151a3e86ab71a6008d0011","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2606.24090, 'Sparsity-adaptive concentration inequalities for random polynomials'] Let $f:\mathbb R^n\to\mathbb R$ be a polynomial of degree $D$. 
