{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.577617+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af3553499fdca723d7a864d5cc4bac4e3923a40ba44e0a8a1554ea519dc361c1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 of arXiv:2608.27372, 'Universality and sharp thresholds for ellipsoid fitting'] Assume the hypotheses of
