{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.497814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af5a7b0bfb923e0037d93d768458802d181ccc1a4f88d6db321d587383f4c734","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 42 of arXiv:2608.28355, 'About the contractibility of the walking coinductive equivalence'] If $\cE$ denotes the walking coinductive equivalence from \cite{ORsurvey,HLOR}, then the following hold:
