{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:44:17.358489+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af5a7e26d04077f7f5601576b0561d2efd9020b8dfcddd7857c8fb623a35aa03","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:df of arXiv:2608.23860, 'Revelation Control'] The obstruction admits the exact decomposition
\begin{equation}
