{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:09:59.306575+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af5bfa1e0ef7d96d6936a5599966d3eea2f05d5331ab4f1f68dfdcc32095c342","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:budget of arXiv:2608.07842, 'Resolution of a Conjecture on Shifted R\'enyi Divergence'] Let $D$ be a scalar $N(a,\tau^2)$ variable with $2\tau^2<w^2$. Then
