{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.353704+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_af5fa7e318cf53859a5379b988ade0d02ec757798f4455ca99da8f0abcdbc518","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] The following approximations hold for $\Phi_{\log}$.
