{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.712428+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_afde8fea1cb23a56baa29a21dba4a68aed105e633a1832261b8a4276e5e78b73","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary Cor:LIL_constant of arXiv:2411.04778, 'Coupling between Brownian motion and random walks on the infinite percolation cluster'] Fix  $d\geqslant 2$ and $\mathfrak{p} \in (\mathfrak{p}_c(d), 1]$. For every $p \in [1,\infty)$, for almost every configuration $\omega\in\Omega$, and for all $y\in\mathscr{C}_\infty(\omega)$, the VSRW $(S_t)_{t\geqslant 0}$ starting from $y$ satisfies the LIL
