{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.704786+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_affd7a09a27a9cdb9a7f518628c5ac66519c4b91ef6c050aa121c9d35b44903f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 15 of arXiv:2608.06038, 'Efron type identities\\ for stopping sets and Poisson hulls'] Let $B\in\cX_0$ and $k\in\N$. Then
  \begin{multline}

