{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:44:24.743231+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b03587e9d9df6e7a22fbc6a949cc82e1f6c1bbd9d618c68bd8e5cf935f78f4c9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:p_bound of arXiv:2605.05193, 'Grokability in five inequalities'] Define the explicit Nazarov main term
