for almost every \( t \in [\delta, b] \).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:58:24.519727+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b0c3981571b4d8c9a8636499fa3da4c74a109d04ef2e254c09f5dd9817e1f724","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem t:joint.sum.max.clique of arXiv:2601.12677, 'Stable and Fréchet limit theorem for subgraph functionals in the hyperbolic random geometr'] Let $\frac{2m-3}{2m-2}<\alpha<1$. Then, as $n\to\infty$, 
