{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.555631+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b0ce5071f8fd06a039c72e43347e708db87b3f6b1526a37714b78fef0811a162","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 (One-scale collision estimate) of arXiv:2609.01436, '2609.01436'] Assume \cref{ass:CL}.  Let $s>0$, $m\geq4$, and $L=ms$, and suppose that
