 \end{eqnarray} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:43.746595+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b130372798d6ef20ec8d46a99b3ab695cf69b81fc5fcec2610a1a9ff35c16f92","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:polygon of arXiv:2412.04284, 'Approximately jumping towards the Origin'] Let $ b\geq 4$. Then, considering $(a_n)_{n \in \mathbb{N}}=\Vdc_b(n)$,
