{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.661364+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b1681dd1880fc8d8b954daf8d1d8b06e994a187743177a6d53e362cfd4796614","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2604.23572, '2604.23572'] The mean amount $\E[U_k^{\PR}]$ ($k \in \K$) of unfinished work
