{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.508860+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2768d0cfe3c35a0f76eb3cfa423615e761b6a7a084dd4b6112cc97aa1827128","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:slow of arXiv:2607.14266, 'The Swapping Mechanism for Interacting Diffusions: Framework, Comparison with Switching, a'] As $st\to 0$, the density $p(x,y,t)$ converges in
