	\end{equation*} (Stated as a conjecture by the paper; open unless the paper says otherwise.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.504350+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b27be1ccd7739972299aa5429ad8bcd020ad91e1b17016237e20ae8b568448e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 78 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] Let $E$ be another Banach space, and let $\varphi \in L(E,W)$ be arbitrary. Setting
