{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:06.332796+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2f1349ad9738fe1c4c491c493e7521548455ce27105fca00c56faa49922d3f8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 25 of arXiv:2607.06745, 'Regularization and asymptotic behaviour of Ornstein-Uhlenbeck evolution operators in infin'] Let $\left\{ B\left(t\right)\mid t\in\mathbb{R}\right\} \subseteq\mathcal{L}\left(X\right)$
