{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:52:51.760732+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b3046f4571be2a95db459e39f2d757e84ccb5c16d20317c3106d45c2ee883825","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem v-V of arXiv:2604.24914, 'SPDEs with time-independent\\ L\'evy colored noise'] Suppose that Hypotheses A and F hold.
