{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.466182+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b30f3ad0faf70e4b280509b57a082c3fb35b33d124a858577d8de946e0faa5c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma semiellipse_n1 of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] For any point $(s, u)\in \cup_{k\in[n]}\cup_{i\in \mathbb{N}}C^l_i$ the following holds true: 
