{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.318381+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b3249c609ebc1340829d0a5e4433db6344f11712a148d796b1e814117332ab59","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 25 (Three spread bounds) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] Let $p \in (0,1)$, $\nu > 0$, and suppose $Y_{p,\nu} \in \SG(1,a)$. Then
\begin{align}
    \nu &\le \frac{1}{\sqrt{p(1-p)}},
    \\
