\end{align}
for some non-random numbers $K_6,K_7,K_8 \in (0\,,\infty)$ that may depend on $t_0$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.699422+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b3e9b46fed3894e37b1bb4bebfb9693fe83a8cba573548123f8a9b25e26cb46c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:excon of arXiv:2411.07809, 'Pirogov--Sinai Theory Beyond Lattices'] Let $\Lambda$ be a finite induced subgraph of $G$ with $\partial
