{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:44:12.641088+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b45462cbd31a71d0c0b8f64a62bdd2a54c6950b56d3895441a7ffdfc0ce8e9ff","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:sigmoid_samples of arXiv:2512.04371, 'Constructive Approximation under Carleman's Condition, \\ with Applications to Smoothed An'] Fix $\varepsilon>0$ and $\delta\in(0,1)$. 
