{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:46.462427+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b4785b86188bae7fb7c21d91f573b53565deb51d77a7b2497ac966950bcd4006","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 22 (Standard $\gfour$-Null forms) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Let $\varphi$ and $\widetilde{\varphi}$ be scalar functions.
