{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.735482+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b48e1a505d53cffb3c3eb899ff4444a77aab1ed7233f9f87f0af2167d7ed1303","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem theo_nonquadratic of arXiv:2503.24372, 'A criterion on the free energy for log-Sobolev inequalities in mean-field particle systems'] Let $V$, $W$ satisfying  Assumptions~(ass_Vnonquad of the paper) and (ass_Wnonquad of the paper). 
