{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:04:39.773281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b49f9968132aa9dfd3b9f09a63033fad91a974cb122b7449ea3829a2ca373979","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Monotonicity of arXiv:2609.01464, 'Removability of non-isolated singularities for Einstein metrics and RCD spaces'] Let $n\geqslant2$, and let $\sigma$ be a locally finite, symmetric,
