{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.520386+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b4a1b648d1746f69268630bc74c2754f725e8edcc1e51f1d40f25b11805c4a65","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{thm:two_dim_recurrence}
