{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.525231+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b4a8959d46733a79dca168680424027230f175ea55f2a65ada0183ba4529e098","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop pr:N_stochastic_object of arXiv:2411.03482, 'Ergodicity of 2D singular stochastic Navier--Stokes equations'] For any $N\geq 2$, there exists a random variable $\Lambda$ such that for any $p \in [1, 6]$, we have
