{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.403570+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b52e651e6565dbea3bb78de7e6a3d81a52603994d3c4960b4a727b807b406a8e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2608.31070, 'Sub-Laplacians on Compact Lie Groups: Heat Kernels, Distance, and Zeta Determinants'] Every normal geodesic issuing from $e$ has the form
		\begin{equation}
