weight operator core matrix of (def:weightcore of the paper).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.456292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b56b58b5dbc35d337f410f3ef22826797b0d58016a42cdad60758169a94ef453","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 15 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Assume Hypothesis \ref{hyplin}. Then, there exist some $\delta_1 \in (0, \;1]$ and some function $g: \mathbb{N} \mapsto \mathbb{R}$ satisfying $\lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} g(n)=0$, such that
	\begin{align} 
