{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.158367+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b57049059fcb247d9f2af110084cec2f43d422dec28b83f0a86d038f8fd430e9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor uniqueness-maps-to-O(n) of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Let $f_1,f_2\colon {\textup{O}}(m)\to {\textup{O}}(n)$ be homomorphisms. Assume that for every block diagonal matrix
    \begin{equation}
        A=\begin{pmatrix}
