{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:09.866252+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b5eac1b997e185ba625dbfe8a3c18e184c35c7a80ae80b6711fcf46c97fdbfba","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 24 of arXiv:2605.21638, 'Markov renewal theory for transfer operators and point processes on the line'] For every measurable function $F\colon \mathbf{N} \rightarrow \R$,
