{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:38.359819+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b5eb326667728b0c8e8f3d46bbd14fd707cd9d37a92b9072f9f4a788e4b80f8f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 of arXiv:2604.21162, '2604.21162'] {\bf(Local weak-type Poincar\'e inequality)} Under {\bf Assumption (H1)}, there exist constants
