{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.492939+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b62ec6339708a7b36bdd3e5baef2276cd8e12bdd2c034e35ac459fb150da22ec","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 of arXiv:2605.09459, 'Multipoint connectivity in the branching interlacement process'] For $d\geq 5$. Let
  \begin{equation}

