{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.496674+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6892bcc94a1ee513a67abb187558fe445e7fd0d1c53e5623bb1cd772ac86368","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2608.18075, '2608.18075'] Fix $T,\nu>0$.  Let $K\in\N$, let
