{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.080337+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6a912a946e375634948ce80651ebf31b310a3c409707e48dc4b356511507452","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem formula of arXiv:2412.08334, 'Maker-Breaker on Galton-Watson trees'] For the (1,1)-game on a GW-tree $T$ arising from offspring distribution $\xi$ and revealed to both players at the start, it holds
