{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:07:17.257828+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6de8e7dd33e4d02d07b0f0411e31d173b4de53f5bc421f3df65052bd54ced3a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma BIRK of arXiv:2603.12774, 'Synchronization by noise for stochastic differential equations driven by fractional Browni'] For each Borel set $A\subseteq \mathbb{R}^d$, it holds that
