{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.593683+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b859c5330640cd8ec2692b5a00072183d424dc7134544785f87e305a1cca7caf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-3.7 of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] For all $\beta>0$ and~$n > k\ge0$,
