{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.673503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b86cbbc4c985143fe8dc9717776efe68dfc96be2662b10f3ceff1d2716f0f180","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2608.04853, 'Minimal-Norm Extensions of Stationary Kernels on Subgroups of Locally Compact Abelian Grou'] Let $k$ be a stationary kernel. Then the norm on $\mathcal{N}(G)$ is given by 
