{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:31.957874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b89272a066fd4d32c27ee6c0a37a18ed7fb726aede04f3691bbe8608c303c628","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm 6 of arXiv:2512.02286, 'Pfaffian Transition Probability and Correlation Kernel of TASEP in Half-space'] For fixed integers $0\leq M\leq N$, let $y=(y_1,\dots,y_M)$ be a half-space particle configuration and let $(w_1,\dots,w_N)\in\mathbb{C}^N$ be a fixed alphabet. Then the function \eqref{eq:F initial coord function} has the following eigenvector relation with the half-space ASEP Markov generator:
