{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.402357+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8f8e9eac8150d71d86f34728395e656747c1e429fd9d67f93ecd9870c66f866","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop: Reduction of arXiv:2603.26932, 'On the satisfaction frequency of spectral characterization conditions'] Suppose that $\bM \sim \operatorname{SymHaar}(\sO^{n\times n})$. 
