{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.103803+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b96238db59878a98e1a861d686cf2737e05c68c8a3a18cd1c544681666adee09","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 (\cite{Li2025}) of arXiv:2609.03823, 'Weak rainbow saturation numbers of paths, stars and cycles'] Let $H$ be a non-empty graph. Then the following statements hold.
