{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.749344+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b96ae21358446c1e351cc0234e3c7bf29ea48290c254f347ba7fc4965231a836","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2608.18834, 'The Parabolic Anderson Model's Total Mass at Small Times: Geometry, Fluctuations, and Reno'] Suppose that Assumption \ref{Assumption} holds, and let $\ka>0$.
