{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:44.951011+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b9e891f428d2771f84958d995dba02f618bd67171f36923b5622b5db63cd9be8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 31 (Upper bound on series summands) of arXiv:2606.24887, '2606.24887'] Let $ 0 < \epsilon <1$ and $0 < \delta < \frac{1}{4} \epsilon$ be fixed. 
