{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:27.584463+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba290d608a5301df075ccede49c773e9947527bddb7fde6bd5976f47159000da","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 21 of arXiv:2603.00353, 'Aldous-type Spectral Gaps in Unitary Groups'] \cite[Cor.~2.4]{collins2006integration} 
    Let $k,d\ge1$, and $i_1,\ldots,i_k,j_1,\ldots,j_k,i'_1,\ldots,i'_k,j'_1,\ldots,j'_k\in[d]$. Then
