{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.292166+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba3495022e95b9e752caa10692a5bf9c5d40c7df358fb0d6cd4ffcb416b78c5f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lg of arXiv:2411.05204, '\Large\bf Sample Path Properties of the Fractional Wiener--Weierstrass Bridge'] There exist constants $C(s)\in[\frac{1}{L},L],~s\in[0,1]$ such that
