{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.114911+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba3a37b1396ff0b17f367199a91002cce243eb915bf19e73959c40c1a4e46b3a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary coro:lower_bound_on_partial_square_term_capacity of arXiv:2505.07145, 'Nonamenable Poisson zoo'] Let $A \subset \subset V(G)$ be finite and connected, $B \subseteq \partial_{\mathrm{ext}} A$. Then we have
