{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.922941+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba48b5fe59f6e15184668eac81818f0d66f4bf2b2a0a6a02c0306079256c285e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_pointtoset_harnack of arXiv:2412.05706, 'Quasi-multiplicativity and regularity for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$, there exists a constant $
