{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.846658+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba58c3792d12b0c7f837d95e2d3c30570eeb6ba164f50a9894d133bca50879ee","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-property-phi of arXiv:2607.08187, 'Asymptotic behaviours of critical branching random walk in $\mathbb{R}^d$'] There exists a positive constant $C_\phi$ such that 
