{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.168872+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba5fdebf4de9d670b1136d0042150ed7b1ebbe9cf069f0ea3b2b29a9432c5112","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 of arXiv:2604.18427, 'Expected perimeter and area of the convex hull of planar Brownian motion stopped upon exit'] Let
