{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.250329+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bab9ec753d3ad7ac747d10bfccb2f3555610de9d18f1a75afd7bde6ce50ab305","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2605.22445, 'Generalized specific entropy on Wiener space with application to Martingale Optimal Transp'] The map
