{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.645212+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_badf9f1611fa68b9094a6857ebc0530c86a355e5be6990f04310effabb1e1596","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 (TV mixing time via Pinsker) of arXiv:2605.24937, '2605.24937'] Assume the conditions of Corollary~\ref{prop:kl-sampling-ktula} and let $\lambda\in(0,\lambda_{\max}^{\mathrm{kTULA}}]$. Fix $\mu\in\mathcal P_2(\R^d)$ and assume $R_0:=R_2(\mu\|\pi_\beta)<\infty$.
