{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.297478+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc2a25fe192f7a3c8654e746f9ce6485d51171872ddb84e6b1ae58d163749bc0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition log-coefficients of arXiv:2608.30212, 'A Painlev\'e equation for the H\"ormander-Bernhardsson constant'] Let $n=2k$ and let $\varphi_j, \psi_j\in (0,\pi)$ satisfy (equation Phi-interlace of the paper). Define $b_\ell$, $\ell\ge 1$ by
