{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.142525+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc32833a5a71ca53d9dd9f612e36c23cfdc8de607dae658a15c95d2132474381","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2608.27630, 'Oriented planar maps and \\ annular mating of trees'] Let $D,h,A,\rho$ be described as above.   We  have the orthogonal decomposition
