{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.540912+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc7b1802988fda427f51576ee90ab23c3fd17e55589131f4502ac12f7ae67995","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LS2 of arXiv:2510.22701, 'Gaussian fluctuations in Mean Field Stable matchings'] For $d>2$, we have that 
