{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.966729+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bcc90e311b41cb17bab4f1e664f6c864b3cb12e244ce1f76e6317ca8d4a41e69","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 32 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {Block-Interaction Matrix}

