{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.894316+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bcd98a61bdf9c76a589acb8490ab76fc8561c33be74da717656fe7e3b8e2a996","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 16 of arXiv:2606.18877, 'Ergodic Properties of Non-Linear Density-Dependent Perturbations of the Ornstein--Uhlenbec'] Let \(Y_t\) be the Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process defined in~\eqref{OU_a0}. Then, for any \(p\geq 1\), it holds that
