{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.040210+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bdb485526808c4eb2f0d3d7dff97296e24369b684cbde69d02fadca2816a37bc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 of arXiv:2606.26619, 'Ergodicity of stochastic reaction-diffusion equations on unbounded domains driven by space'] Assume that (S1)--(S3) and (H5) hold, and that
