{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:23.327453+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bdf5959460259418f2ccbb4a17abd1f5bba3728444d9e8d85ca49e7e0f8fabe5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2506.21164, 'Instantaneous blowup for interacting SDEs with superlinear drift'] Let  $\mathcal X_t=\sum_1^{N_t} \mathcal Z_i$ be the random walk as in the introduction. 
