{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.625815+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be27aa1e79ee213eaab93d2b18919074554f0e41f1bc6e10d50475b6144806f3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:decomposition into boxes of arXiv:2609.01825, 'On everywhere locally soluble varieties \\ in families over toric bases'] Let $\gamma > \max_{1\leq l\leq k} \sum_{i=1}^s \frac{\varpi_{li}}{\alpha_i}$ and set
	\begin{equation*}\textstyle
		\vec U_{\!-} = \bigl(\frac{\log (B/X_1)}{\log \theta}, \dots, \frac{\log (B/X_k)}{\log \theta}\bigr)
