{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.515236+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be3eed64115c7cdee569a731a2a0b718b25c9bc979819a342464f7758b03e175","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition4prime 15 of arXiv:2608.28528, 'Strong solutions of SDEs with critical discontinuities in diffusion coefficients'] For every $r \geq 1$, there exist constants $K_1$, $K_2$ (independent of smoothness or boundedness of $b$) such that

