{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.119138+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be48dcace13134f5fb17137332d278f8effa511a338f85b33c94fa6f7ed69309","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: property for di in adding external field of arXiv:2606.13147, 'Scaling limits of the single-curve interface and outermost loops in the planar random fiel'] Under the assumptions in Proposition~(prop: adding external field fluctuation of the paper), $d_i$ (recalling (equation eq: def of di in adding external field of the paper)) satisfies condition (item: di of the paper), i.e., \begin{align}

