    \item[(3c)] If $\xi^{\modi}_{t_-}(x) =\Aup$ and $\xi^{\modi}_{t_-}(x+1) = \Bup$, then set $(\xi^{\modi}_{t}(x),\xi^{\modi}_{t}(x+1))=(\zerop,\onep)$,  
