{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.682814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bee854bc5f7a503a1763d6c1f0e139477aba69e63e94e0fad797bfaa5d6920d2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:optimal of arXiv:2412.00279, 'Optimal local storage policy based on stochastic intensities and its large scale behavior'] For any causal policy $\mathcal{C}(t)$, its stationary hit rate $h_{\mathcal{C}}$ satisfies:
