{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.157488+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bef634bdecb3303a0e19c8d54ba5efb4954322cfddb8f78d29e2052351c6c30c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2607.02108, 'A Two-Color Lift of the Shifted \texorpdfstring{$t$}{t}-Schur Measure'] For $k\geq0$,
\begin{equation}
        \Prob(B=k)
