 \forall x,y \in \mathbb{Z}: |y-x| \geq 2 K, \; \forall s \in [0,T], \; \forall n \in \mathbb{N}_+, \quad & \mathbb{E}_{\nu_{\rho}} \big[ F_x(\eta_r^n) \; F_y(\eta_r^n) \big]=0. 
