{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.322538+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf85f222623121027775f922985dbda84715143ff3095bf3001fc8aefa38ce72","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Degree zero) of arXiv:2608.30304, '2608.30304'] For all $\alpha,\beta\ge-\tfrac12$ and all $x\in[-1,1]$,
