{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.540695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf8b495fe284298a681268e12795febfe2b54033c4f38b4f929da70c8eec2648","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 (Ideal-completion extension) of arXiv:2608.25925, '\textbf{Jump Closure and Limit Uniformization\\in the Ideal Completion of the Turing Degre'] Let $P$ be a poset and let $f:P\to P$ be monotone. Define
