{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:30:28.827692+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf9d385212b0287e92943ce6bbd310f322b9f58840ae63f6c76ac8e57abadc88","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 18 of arXiv:2609.02105, 'Contact fundamental forms and \\ adjoint varieties'] In the notation of Definition \ref{d.Spencer}, we have the following.
