{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.460178+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bfdc1a1437cc21ea87f0c021354b015da079a558c6fb7809248f704837cc67c6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Lower_env of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] Associated with the marked Poisson point process of the stations
