{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.323059+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c035aec33f1b6c4965a438158825ffe314f2932dfda323c25a7a85984f0ac904","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 16 of arXiv:2608.30304, '2608.30304'] Let $a,b\in[-\tfrac12,A_0]$ and suppose
