{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.428143+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c05832fc59714b44e2d8e4ede38bc39cc9525c7a1fb6e27be7fde931f25a8106","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:1 of arXiv:2604.20094, 'Persistence and local extinction for superprocesses in random environments'] Let $\rho>d\geqslant 3$. Assume that
