{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.252420+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0af44536b538b8bf6290f5c48ab5429fc8e1d5046cc5484eca71b7f739da575","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm 6 of arXiv:2605.23292, 'Second-order Poincaré inequalities and localization on the Poisson space'] Let $h \in L^2(\mathbf{N} \times \WW)$ and let $\tau \in (0,1)$. Then $P_\tau h$ satisfies
