{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.046816+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0c27dd1b39f60e35d8beeb960f11836ed8aef22301b04454b6603833acb32c2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 17 (Coloring-adapted average $\tau$-coefficient) of arXiv:2606.31936, 'Coupling and Maximal Inequalities for Graph-Dependent Empirical Processes'] Given a $\mathcal B \subseteq \mathcal F$ and a partition-coloring pair $\left\{
