{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:00.612179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c104c98d5452f5124f961fdcf8ca945b0b886dd8a2f00c6344d4ebae35f0860f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 14 (\cite{bolbotowski2024kantorovich}, Theorem 1.3) of arXiv:2510.27451, 'Bi-martingale optimal transport and its applications'] For any pair of probabilities $\mu,\nu \in \mathcal{P}^\ba_2(\Rd)$  the following equality holds true,
