{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:44.947699+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c11e21c2cd1e27cd9e4f62fde2d1d17f6fc864653b9cd1d87e0c47d0586c453a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2606.24599, '\bf Perron--Frobenius theorem for a general tree-valued growth-fragmentation-isolation pro'] Let $g: [0, \infty)\to\mathbb{R}$ be a continuous function, $C \in \R$,  and $c \in \R_+$. Assume the following estimate for all $0\leq s\leq t$
