	\item[(ii)] The process $\{ \Gamma^n (t), 0 \leq t \leq T\}$ converges in distribution, as $n \rightarrow \infty$, to the same process $\{Z_t, 0 \leq t \leq T\}$ as in {\rm (i)} in the space $C([0,T], \mathbb R)$.
