{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.468152+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1b327e4c8c11e0fdb27cf0435943752907e686c290ccbd25bc853bc4c885887","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:estimate-contour of arXiv:2511.17101, 'Central limit theorem for the range of critical branching random walk'] For every $\gamma>2$, 
