{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.367630+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1c71f8dc81d54ccc1998b1ea041bfb8f28844f3e4b47c768b797e039b34f84a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:lil:D:E of arXiv:2607.20956, 'Sharp moduli of continuity for Gaussian fields and stochastic PDEs via correlation bounds'] Under (equation alphaH=3/2 of the paper), there exists a constant $C\in (0\,,\infty)$ such that
