{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.671204+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1f94689ea14d6feebf8ef1a303e2ca1770c15ad54eb75f9a04450e63c7e22a9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 of arXiv:2604.24392, 'Numerical approximation of Markovian BSDEs in infinite horizon and elliptic PDEs'] {Let $p\geqslant 2$.}
