{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.710071+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c2a474bf63f63beb15c18ba07eff405b0691d55b63e3f67898ba68ea5c76ef45","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:2ptfncrestt of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Under the assumptions of Proposition~(prop:mgfref of the paper),  also let $\pi_{\hash} V_0 = \sigma_\hash \lambda^{(\emptyset)}_{0, \hash} \varphi^{(1)}_\hash$ for both $\hash \in \{{\sf o},{\sf x}\}$.  Then
