{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.068480+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c33c2585194df741cb1b077f89f7bbcbf5b4698725668e10ba6220f96e294238","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 of arXiv:2606.27774, 'Variational Formulas for the Spectrum of\\ Block Wishart Matrices'] Fix $\alpha\in(0,\infty)$, integer $k\ge1$, $\nu\in\cuP_0(\sa{k}{\C})$. 

