{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.288811+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c34ff24d08e07ec86b2c1870fff8f08369a04f2aa45623e0f1dce7fd3834e96d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop of arXiv:2411.04802, 'Dynkin ghost games with asymmetry and consolation'] If $\gamma_2$ is a $\Gamma^2-$randomised stopping time and $\tau$ is a stopping time, then
