{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.658485+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c396dee590a24e07d99128a9f35d378761650c8ad378ab28fa7aa877d83aa2ef","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm split_sharp of arXiv:2604.07183, 'Stopping on the last success with unknown odds: asymptotic minimax optimality of the plug-'] Fix~$p_0\in(0,\frac12)$ and~$a\in(0,1)$, and let~$C_\star$ and~$u_\star$ be as in Theorem~(thm:plugin_sharp of the paper). Then,
