{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:14.240414+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c4578883dd92ed9d16d3a6760188775021d4fdb7f894fc809a8228078d7ac262","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop connection of arXiv:2412.09471, 'On the moderate deviation principles in the sparse multi-type Erd\H{o}s R\'enyi random gra'] For all $(\gamma_k)\in{\mathbb N}^{{\mathbb S}_n}$ such that $\sum_{k\in {\mathbb S}_n}k\gamma_k=\mu^n n$, 
    \begin{multline*}
