X^{L_{n}}=(X_{1}^{L_{n}},\dots ,X_{d}^{L_{n}})\sim L_{n},\qquad
I_{n}=E[\prod_{i=1}^{d}X_{i}^{L_{n}}].  
\end{equation}

The $d$--dimensional analogue of the map ((5.1 of the paper)) is given by 
