{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.612196+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c466be50cdec47ea83222a8e4b4573a5463419eb6cc3c16ec6fe0807b38770f7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 36 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Let $\Bessel_{\beta,a}=\{\lambda_{1,a}^B< \lambda_{2,a}^B< \cdots\}$, then we have 
