{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.640316+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c501e6af345667263fa6100f72e584730d1783ecb4e33757fd5487c267819af7","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 (Terminal atomic mass) of arXiv:2608.30715, 'Endpoint Energy Atoms Force Local Pressure Concentration in Three-Dimensional Navier--Stok'] For an \(L^2\)-bounded field \(q(t)\), a point \(a\in\Omega\), and a terminal
