{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:38.359632+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c506e1b4689b63b4aa35234cb1c5e707bb718cf23c55c286d452529d3214a749","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 17 (Off-diagonal heat kernel bound {\cite[Theorem~1.12) of arXiv:2604.21143, 'Quantitative homogenization for the critical long-range random conductance model'] {ChenKumagaiWang2019}}]

