{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.285118+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c528142e43fc588ea01aa794eb0bc2e2bb8393f33b29c57e611825e93f161d4d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma3 of arXiv:2411.01731, '$L^2$-Wasserstein contraction of modified Euler schemes for SDEs with high diffusivity and'] Assume   (equation EY* of the paper) and
