{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.354056+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5a77538495acfca0543113536d9a4bcc2a0d76b87b055d67e7afcb0fb05768d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.halfrelaxed of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] For each $p > 4$, $\mathcal{V}_p^+$ is upper semicontinuous on $[0,1)\times {\mathcal P}_p({\mathbb R})$ and satisfies
