{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:48:02.412461+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5ed294c8392a75518004fdfdd20296d2459a7fe436cc312c92a0c66e3a36d52","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lma:discriminantterms of arXiv:2608.26564, 'Real ideal points, Conway spheres, and left-orderable Dehn fillings'] The constant, linear, and quadratic homogeneous parts of $\Delta_1$, $\Delta_2$ vanish. The cubic homogeneous parts are
