{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.398860+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c615fbed73960d894dca79a6d2fb6a85da6fb25555d24413a0cdc996ece2d2e5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2609.04143, 'The Geometry of Real Anisotropic Bohnenblust--Hille Constants'] \textcolor{black}{On every convex permutation-invariant set
