{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.430178+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c619a2511c5a4155072706a938160b4de4990ee6f785d637b5f80b0ed2a70e88","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: 1D-cokernel of arXiv:2603.26932, 'On the satisfaction frequency of spectral characterization conditions'] Let $q \de p^{\deg(\beta)}$.
