{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:03:59.406583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c66a96ed1afea4c789c9db21823ea4be86bc16a12730722965be7b4605ad5c5a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm:B-cK of arXiv:2507.08757, 'Strong existence and uniqueness of the tilt-indexed Busemann process in the planar corner '] Fix ${\widehat B}\in\widehat{\mathcal{K}}$. 
