{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.992570+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6abfd5616e51893258b1c9e70d5551af62a2adfb664630221699d5210295287","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2607.13273, 'Asymptotics of transition densities for L\'evy processes with stochastic resetting'] For every $\lambda < m$ we have 
