{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.713755+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c717a0398b57a409fd45478999dfede673e3ca3bc6fbb7c05700a05c97914291","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2608.29736, '2608.29736'] Let $(M^n,\omega)$ be a compact K\"ahler manifold of complex
