{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:49.835801+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c74cd5bd4198c9e449fbd3009a0bd8364ff5311185c413518319c57ad23ced35","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 (Pure jump L\'evy noise) of arXiv:2506.12834, 'Space-time fractional stochastic partial differential equations driven by L\'evy white noi'] Let $p\in[1,2]$ and  the parameters $(\alpha,\beta,\gamma,d,p)$ satisfy the inequality
