{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.580372+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c78a69e122724688c19d0e20f9ff05d549bce271268ec9c255e3d9c9ce4ed753","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 46 of arXiv:2608.27372, 'Universality and sharp thresholds for ellipsoid fitting'] For $\kappa>1$ and $\zeta\in\R$, let $\kappa^\vee$ be as in
