{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.321389+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c80e032c6600a4152708c4140c7922dc0e2425b3f7493e74bc771b2169615088","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm-slow-ordering-sub-critical of arXiv:2607.22324, 'The conclave process'] {}
