{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:32:58.302979+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c82232ff3776a7575d2e41049c63ed76acc6663202b3f6897ea035b20d0efcc3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:action_correlation of arXiv:2505.10256, 'Stochastic Oscillators out of equilibrium:\\ scaling limits and correlation estimates'] For each $x,y\in V_N^{(2)}$, we have that 
