{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.607490+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c89b365fcae5732aa4b9fe0da7a0d943c89c98839e76572ac38dcbe206e70faf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 of arXiv:2506.08775, 'Markovian multivariate Hawkes population processes: Efficient evaluation of moments'] If $\bm{H}_{i}^{p_{i}\times p_{i}}$ is invertible for all $i\in\{1,\ldots,n\}$,
