{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.325358+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c8e5e65f89dc5f9a857f5077e21391b4ed942528a73417c8e3014a78dba14dd3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] The global $\infty$-category ${\mathpalette\ulhelper{\mathfrak S\kern-.5pt\mathfrak p}}\hbox{\rule[-2pt]{0pt}{0pt}}$ is fiberwise presentable.
