{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:15:09.027947+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c93d84a02f4beda3cc6dd375c6c15fc09e2983e0cb1c879d742253825fa78b5e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop IXHGest of arXiv:2411.10829, 'Airy$_\beta$ line ensemble and its Laplace transform'] Take any constants $C_1, D, d>0$.
