{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.784726+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c93e917464e53b37bfcc26e7779194968ccaeb83eb54a8f27090db418a890ede","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 42 (Hypercontractivity of the Ornstein--Uhlenbeck semigroup) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] For $p>1$ and $t>0$, let 
