	\] (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:01:48.648505+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9b8c69fe7c20fa72c95d5a3ed3e84e247019b42011512021490f7806f00db26","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:vm of arXiv:2607.04002, 'Collisions of random walks in unimodular random graphs: applications to the random geometr'] For each $G \in \{ \mathcal G_\mathrm{SGil},\mathcal G_\mathrm{Del}, \mathcal G_\mathrm{Gab} \}$, the following holds:
