{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:30:08.198037+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9c18d522fb5c8a5be9fc82a92daa5acabaf7f1120251bb7d97e2f4edd7b4cf4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:constant_local_holder of arXiv:2608.13452, 'Wasserstein stability of the zero cell of a Poisson hyperplane tessellation under directio'] Let \(\phi_0\) be an even nondegenerate probability measure on
    \(S^{d-1}\).
