    \(\varepsilon_0>0\), \(a_0>0\), \(0<\Delta< \infty\) and pairwise disjoint open sets
    \(U_1,\ldots,U_{2d}\subset S^{d-1}\), depending only on \(\phi_0\), such
    that the following hold:

