        If $E_*=E_+$, then \eqref{eq:opt_anis_ll}--\eqref{eq:gap_avg_ll} hold uniformly for $\{E_+-\eps_*\leq E\leq\tau^{-1}, N^{-1+\tau}\leq\eta\leq1\}$, with the gap side estimate \eqref{eq:gap_avg_ll} restricted to $E\geq E_+$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

