{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.492844+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca51d3a746087e352fb4557771612cbd8679a32859d20483aa89d8005cff2649","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 246 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] We define
