{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.983435+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca535edebd76829b54a4f463c1e6ec76baeacb0c6fc96d9c514df24ff49dd21c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi of arXiv:2412.05999, 'Non-Archimedean GUE corners and Hecke modules'] Let $L(G^{\her},K)$ (resp. $L(G^{+{\her}},K)$) denote the space of all complex-valued continuous functions of compact support on $G^{\her}=G\cap{\Her}_n(F)$ (resp. $G^{+{\her}}=G^+\cap{\Her}_n(\mathfrak{o})$) which are invariant with respect to $K$, i.e., such that

