{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.900876+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca5694cbc4de6dbf86759f5af34b73767cf2f7fd0136a023ed5dffaec2adb343","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 18 (Weyl's perturbation theorem; {\cite[III.2.6) of arXiv:2606.20816, 'Spectral Properties of Dense Barab\'asi--Albert Graphs'] {BhatiaMatrixAnalysis}}]
