{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.886508+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca85b651665c66f5bf561299ecafd0875a7afc16e2c2c2f446260ce56013eb88","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposizione 8 of arXiv:2506.11937, 'Random rotational invariance of integration by parts formulas within a Bismut-type approac'] Given a differential operator \eqref{L}
