{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.548694+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca88efed1bf9359ff12cf1683a65d34a70bc5e6d8f112468e8fdb8bb5169b146","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thrm:bound of arXiv:2511.01058, 'Limit profiles and cutoff for the Burnside process on Sylow double cosets'] Fix \(p \ge 11\), \(1 \le k <p\) and \(\sigma \in S_{pk}\). If \(|H\sigma H|=p^a\), then for all \(t \ge 1\)
