{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.101722+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca8972839b67b071b811bdb9c965a5edc66e658e30d660f91e2dedc228dac2a4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma density Theta1 of arXiv:2411.14350, 'Randomized Geodesic Flow on Hyperbolic Groups'] For all $\xi,\eta\in \partial G$, we have 
