{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.879163+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca9b2880369b601ed8e159946f59464d34a86c89e08dd9083873ea0456575819","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 of arXiv:2609.02478, 'Improved Weyl bounds on short intervals'] Let $k\ge3$ be fixed and let $\varepsilon>0$.  Suppose that
