{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.056316+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca9df8e5699c8c47cc0f3819a43fefbdb957c74e82156588ee23604d0eb1ed21","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l.equival_jumps of arXiv:2411.14105, 'Simultaneous replica-symmetry breaking \\ for vector spin glasses'] Let $s\in[0,1)$. The following are equivalent:
