{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.730698+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cae580e300e94b4ff3bd2c8ce00259f540ffdd2c6206286769aa79303346d9e0","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 2 of arXiv:2609.01237, ''] For each $v \in H^1(\Omega)$, we say that $v$ satisfies \textbf{Condition $\cA$} if and only if
