{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:58:24.522650+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cb276749b0599326691bfd28f1738c6ced24613d187115c053fc745ae31fad6f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l:negligible.BCDE of arXiv:2601.12677, 'Stable and Fréchet limit theorem for subgraph functionals in the hyperbolic random geometr'] In the setting of Proposition (p:exp.clique of the paper), there exist $C, c_0 \in (0,\infty)$, both of which are independent of $n$ and $u$, such that 
