{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.571107+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ccbbc911b8f13b80426f2e9c47104a22b6ca4e5b87ad45671a8d5a9210091b08","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2412.04589, 'Inverting the Markovian projection for pure jump processes'] We use the following notation.
