{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.587366+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd06be568c2d840993f2fa278838c593654d22527d72ae576fbb4f82fa818dcf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Prop.BDG of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For two constants $p\geq 1$ and $T>0$, assume that
 	\begin{eqnarray*}
