{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.555199+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd4de2ddd3bd81a8fd1d6a38fb12e1a1b8ec2b20559417e5e72f917e2469ff09","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2609.01826, 'An extension theory for fully fractional Schr\"odinger equations with memory'] Let \(a>-1\) and \(t\neq 0\). Then we define the boundary kernel 
