{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.962241+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd51d7beb178fc76555f7e55b27535a4ee69fa1bfaf0a5163f291b4373616205","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 2 of arXiv:2607.22414, 'Asymptotic fluctuations in supercritical multi-type Crump--Mode--Jagers processes'] Assume~\ref{assumpt:Malthusian alpha} through~\ref{assumpt:hreprMoments} hold and let $\varphi$ be a characteristic with c\`adl\`ag paths satisfying~\ref{assumpt:dRimean}. Then
