{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.953476+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cdb815f0e0d041e09936420cfb4df5cd2bf0b728fbe2b5ac1de22ee6c1128310","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Membre1 of arXiv:2602.08591, 'The Yang--Mills measure on compact surfaces as a \\ universal scaling limit of lattice gau'] For $N\geqslant  n$, we have 
