{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.730310+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce28dcadd8eba12157d4b20b5b34f6314b00ecd93d625acd1480a6ca09ca0111","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 7 of arXiv:2609.01231, 'MULTI-HEAD SELF ATTENTION IS A PARAMETER IDENTIFICATION MECHANISM'] Using a RoPE encoding in a transformer we have $D$-dimensional invariance in query-key products ($(\C \setminus \{0\})^{D/2}$ instead of $GL_D(\R)$) of the form 
