{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.765218+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce2ba348b3be448f1d740983e4e8293586cca75bea49de8aa966406ce397d88a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Satz thm:target-statement-necessity of arXiv:2411.18155, 'Besov regularity of random wavelet series'] Let $d\in\mathds{N}$, $s,\alpha,\beta,\gamma,\theta \in\mathds{R}$, and $p,q\in (0,\infty]$.
