{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.723323+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce2c015939791f73f1ed05b94fc4db6f063f9f77289c3e581a3d0fb693e2b935","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:lambdainfty of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assume (equation asmp:obsRG of the paper).  
