{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.772752+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce5c2985234380912f4fa700ec12a1014506eb80a8daa1a79d7edde012ce2050","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defin of arXiv:2411.03065, 'Growing conditioned BGW trees with\\ log-concave offspring distributions'] For $\tau\in\mathbbm{t}$ and a vertex $\mathtt{u}\in\tau$, we define ${\boldsymbol{C}}(\tau)=({{C}}_\mathtt{u}(\tau))_{\mathtt{u}\in\tau}$ the collection of \textit{children-positions}, where:
