{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.359513+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce5d046286df2ccabcd6eef7d2eb787b27d512898266d7aaf1aad61e50922040","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma bm-construction-iterated of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] The process $(\bm W(t)-\bm W(t_0))_{t_0\le t\le 1}$ is a Brownian motion in ${\mathbb R}^n$, and
