&\hspace{0.5cm}+ M^k(32k)^{k/2} \exp\left(8k^2t\right) \exp\left(\frac{k\sqrt{\beta t}}{\mathcal R} \log\left(\frac{\mathcal Re\sqrt t}{\sqrt \beta}\right)\right). \\

