{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.714765+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ced7b727e9c48befb2c3a93b373c90c3bc2ef0ef2f97fc71a8a804db1e42b2f1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma-Laplace-Kernel of arXiv:2609.01964, 'The critical exponent for the two-dimensional semilinear wave equation with strong damping'] For $s>0$ and $r>0$, one has
