{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.371576+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cee8121ca9eaac0a83fb2890164581ff70b09c315d542c17227464b4218d7093","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2512.08595, 'Small time asymptotics of spectral heat content of isotropic processes'] Let $\phi:\R^d\to\R$ be a $C^{1}$ function such that 
