{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.504551+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cf02a48d7a5e0599f36514a1c7c0c74233f5074fff5637910c0573d5c111811b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 81 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] We endow the space $\scrd_{S,X}^{2 \alpha}([0,T], W)$ with the seminorm
