{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:39:18.525752+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfea77c5a4c71db317ed69ac646e118905947697f760bb0b9275a94222253952","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 46 (Cofinality and exhaustion) of arXiv:2609.02267, 'Locally Conformally Flat Manifolds with Positive Scalar Curvature: Kleinian Groups, Moduli'] Put $E_j:=S^n\setminus V_j$ and
