{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.437177+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d044854ce1954b84005f23f184cd486c59003e558032636221f1fdd3ca3f71e6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:largesingkeloop of arXiv:2508.09291, '1+O(1) asymptotics for loop percolation in five and higher dimensions'] Suppose $d\ge 3$. As $m\to\infty$ and for $\left| x \right|=o(m)$
