  In particular,
  \begin{equation*}
    \pi_{A,N}\left(0<\norm{x}_2\leq s\right)
    \sim
    c_{A,N}s^{\beta_{A,N}}
    \qquad \mbox{as } s\downarrow0 .
  \end{equation*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.010294+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d1d72325dcc2cab3b9d52333dca9715966feaa7ea7a1007125d72522e02ec991","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 35 of arXiv:2609.02808, 'Minimizers of Laplace eigenvalues under a lower curvature bound'] Assume \eqref{eq:intro-density} and \eqref{eq:normalization}. Then
