{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.486543+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d208568fd0d280fdf732cc1f320179fc6cb5591f2235020efe5bd8b45dd52373","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 81 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let $n\geq 1$.
