where one may take $C_{\mathrm{pw}}'(\mu,v,n)=C_{\mathrm{pw}}(\mu,v,n)C_{\mathrm{pt}}(\mu)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

