{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.728614+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d27346246866ecb704619fdf51c7a70e6b2e6ba61e804464ee0ddbff757c87c6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:m-SDE of arXiv:2604.20008, 'Mixing times of Langevin dynamics for \\ spiked matrix models'] The marginal process $m_t$ satisfies the following: 
