{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.064429+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2838b1c5d6957540be3ee1a015893d1c8fb7073734e4092e1aff2e3a92f54ef","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor Q1ll of arXiv:2508.04954, 'Conditional exponential directed last passage percolation under a one-point upper large de'] As $L\to \infty$, the following hold:
