{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.882758+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d289101b4a7189e5d6f3349181c18d75a70da5b190b1eb43c3c0c5ab3e066fea","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 10 of arXiv:2608.29157, 'Dilator-based analysis of $\KP$'] Let us recursively define $\sfK^D\colon \psi^+(D)\to \bigl[D\bigl(\psi^+(D)\bigr)\bigr]^{<\omega}$ as follows:
