{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.561900+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2a13f0a6f46bee014eb20b17e3909acf52bd013ac459e8346a8160c79b00e71","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:PZ of arXiv:2604.08129, 'Polarity of points for Gaussian random fields in critical dimension'] Let $(\mu_n)_{n \ge 1}$ be a sequence of random positive Borel measures on a compact set $I \subset {\mathbb R}^N$.
