{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:27:25.788913+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2e054b0d626865317151afe2cafa2e2bac3f2cd56b8f7b33161875f7918dd86","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem pure-phase-decay-of-correlations of arXiv:2605.08052, 'Rapid phase ordering of Ising dynamics on $\mathbb Z^2$'] Let $\pi_\infty^-$ be the infinite volume minus measure, and fix some finite sets $U,V$. For $\beta>\beta_0$, we have 
