{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.897734+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d344e7d140aef90526e88b8f8b5b7c2ef95b8b0f3bd47c6374501d2f4bb4cad3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition alter of arXiv:2512.19897, 'On the convoy of the ASEP speed process'] For any $n\geq1$, we have
