{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:26:47.148927+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d3602a01181501ae1761ffa15b065aac8fe1ba389ee2ecba66666816315c75eb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2608.29361, 'Convergence of the subcritical $\gamma$-LQG metric to the critical $2$-LQG metric as $\gam'] (\cite[Lemma~3.3]{kavvadias2025continuity})

