{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:41:33.831358+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d3aa91d7a47293ac3802e026a5ac251c5e9d6cd18176e20999e73c1a12636671","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 19 (Reduced coordinate chart) of arXiv:2604.10792, 'Variable-Length Markov Chains on Finite Quivers: Boundary-Window Identifiability, Exact De'] Fix a visible depth $\ell$ and a neighborhood of $q_{\cQ}^{(\ell)}(\theta_0)$.
