{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.573304+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d3b87dbcb6d783c820255dffd7463706003e3cc47f1b8dd7d2ba6cd99ddfe45c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm main of arXiv:2509.03065, 'Mathematical research with GPT-5: a Malliavin-Stein experiment'] For integers $p\neq q$, with $p$ odd, $q$ even, let
