{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:31.998960+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d3b9476873d6b8ea67402768c2731f155e8bc3addca7826d249448e6d13f5fa7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2512.02661, 'Worst-case mixing estimates for Brownian motion with semipermeable barriers'] There exist absolute constants $\delta_0, \gamma, c>0$ such that the following holds for $\delta \leq \delta_0$.
