{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.875509+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d4544a356cbe71d3661faacde6ee86162bf89d37f5424bbd077e0cb02fd66bc5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 51 (Mixed Schatten profile and incidence reduction) of arXiv:2607.16724, 'Algebraic Transfer for Operator-Valued Gaussian Chaoses: Oriented Schatten Profiles and Si'] Let $\mathbf c=(c_1,\ldots,c_m)$ with $c_j\in\ell^2(\Gamma)$.  For every
