{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.271839+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d459e159a9e1dc311cb5302d2ea350b330f85deb13e9e2b80c4ff67a0a77666c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 (Dense-frequency separation) of arXiv:2609.01116, 'Vector-Carleson, Calder\'on, and Poisson--Atomic Criteria for\\ Generalized Hilbert Operat'] For every $2<p<\infty$ there is $\phi\in\Hol(\D)$ such that:
