{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.352455+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d469d73444200f13142975b85297a3516006b6f790cb249a259611db34c90cfe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] Let $I$ denote a uniformly random independent set in $\Qp$.
