{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.968387+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d4de700e0c9dc7d67cc499dae6f4e2a29bdaddf9d6c584a4a155f62e373fb2a3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 (Resolvent representation of hitting) of arXiv:2607.13210, 'Punctured Wilson--Evolving Sets and Root Identities for Massive Kirchhoff Forests'] For $x,y$ in $V$, let
