    \end{equation}
    {The time degrees $\deg_{{\color{NavyBlue}{\mathbf{0}}}}(\bm r)$ and $\deg_{{\color{NavyBlue}{\mathbf{0}}}}(\bm s)$ are only required to be finite.}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.611549+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d533b38a780905c290c88a0ed21c373f78d9ee3b18fa653cd75a7c2feb34190a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 28 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Define 
