{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:53.187471+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d53c3184334b99b5f2a7877c116728661088be12bd6c745d448d7a649e4bdbf5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 44 (\(r\)-tail compensator estimate) of arXiv:2606.11758, '2606.11758'] There exist constants \(C_\gamma<\infty\) and \(c_\gamma>0\) such that, for
