{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.418750+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d540d3a63be117e060397570e9bda181e38bf503fc6d003672e515316f6c79c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2606.08776, 'Approximation of certain stochastic integrals with anticipating integrands'] Let $\sigma_N^\theta$, $N>M$, be the nets from \cref{def:time_nets}.
