{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:52:32.335031+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5c3e147c0f1f1d5ea1d7a5af0ae8615936c7204426364692d57026de4665c65","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:GCCimpliesD of arXiv:2609.03980, 'Decay Rates and Domain Dependence of a Coupled Wave-Heat System with Spatially Dependant H'] Let $(\Omega_w,\gamma)$ be an admissible Lipschitz pair in $\mathbb{R}^n$ with $\gamma$ controlling $\Omega_w$ in time.
