{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:22:59.716484+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d63bbd5fea2affedf1a72e2153fea7d51abd3b1f7645016c3c82fd742ec5b7f7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary thm:eik-completeness of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] Let $\textbf{IKI} \coloneq \textbf{IK} + \textsf{CD}$, then:
