{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:28.178209+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d65ca5a0374ff8168cf98636ee48e81835211efc1b352b6d18ee47eb42ecded5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor spec-frag-pos-recurrent of arXiv:2511.10223, 'Stochastic Reaction Networks Within Interacting Compartments with Content-Dependent Fragme'] Let $N$ be the coarse-grained model associated to (equation eq:specific-content-dependent-fragmentation of the paper):
