{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:06:55.296615+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d6e0b7ac999936c2d9bbef1cfdbec2b96e72e97c4c601c1d80e705cd9d5701ed","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:single-mode of arXiv:2602.19192, 'Bakry--\'Emery Curvature of the Fractional Laplacian\\ via Fractional Brownian Covariance'] For $f(x) = \cos(nx + \varphi)$:
