{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:40:22.308350+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d74d8000b63393ea2793fb41ec600c90951c4632c8434adb25659e0a93a8bc3f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: fan gon of arXiv:2609.03755, 'The Scramble Number of Outerplanar Graphs'] Let $F_m$ be the fan graph on $m+1$ vertices. If $m = k^2+c$ for some $k\in {\mathbb Z}_{>0}$ with $0\leq c\leq 2k$, then
