{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.106298+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d78b694c5474be401544dae1b925c16697dfeaeb351c1aca6a561a05f7eee7de","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma random-walk of arXiv:2505.04942, '\textbf{Randomized Routing to Remote Queues}'] Assume condition~(equation eq:rmk-inequality of the paper) holds. Then with probability 1,
