{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.778292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7c370b3b93d2c5fd6b187217ba422962291a85f80e329ab165c3f86a3c28feb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem::one_arm_bd_aux1 of arXiv:2411.01467, 'Conformal covariance of connection probabilities \\ in the 2D critical FK-Ising model'] With an appropriate choice of the sign of $\nu(e_2^{a,\diamond})$, we have 
