{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:13:22.526894+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d82f598940742cc6dfeb98984d3b290f0821f673fd8fec7bd5c47f53890041f0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq.DFmu_formula of arXiv:2506.07158, 'The diffusivity of supercritical Bernoulli percolation is infinitely differentiable'] For every $F \subseteq E_d({\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m)$ with $\vert F \vert = k \geqslant 1$, we have the following identity
