	uniformly over $0 < \delta < \eps < 1$ for every $q \in [2, \infty)$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:10.013742+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d88bd404bce05e2f22d4fdf891859423ba3c4c5af701f65f46b47fb76e69fa7a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 14 of arXiv:2602.14618, 'Finitary coding and Gaussian concentration\\ for random fields'] Under the same condition as in Theorem \ref{main-thm-ffiid}, we have
