{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.364010+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d88c5eefeb19e93512ed1c4666f7791618aa595ad41273ba6e04ee42cd800152","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop-kinetic of arXiv:2507.09922, 'A scaling limit for Vlasov equations with electrostatic fluctuations'] Fix $\delta>0$. For any $t>0$, it holds
