{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:58:24.513481+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d896aba7a5f1d27f257a86990d006e8961b83b511b1a614355d4b5cde1ff9503","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn rr of arXiv:2601.09537, 'Gene genealogies in haploid populations evolving according to sweepstakes reproduction'] {\bf{( $\alpha$ and $\Psi_N$ both random)} }

Suppose a diploid population evolves according to the diploid
