{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.028056+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d94195d8205469eb196f7d0c2a975a74caf164f1bfc77383291a032b814861c8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma empirical-balancing of arXiv:2609.03858, 'High-Dimensional Learning Dynamics of \\ Attention-Indexed Models'] Fix \(T>0\), and let $N_T:=\left\lfloor\frac{Td}{\alpha_d}\right\rfloor$.
