\]
Then, for any $t>0$ and $x \in \mathbb{R}$,
\begin{equation}

\mathbb{E}\left| \int_0^t\int_{\mathbb{R}}G_{t-s}(x-y)\Phi(s,y)L(ds,dy) \right|^p \le A_{t,p} \int_0^t\int_{\mathbb{R}}
