{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.929846+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da1889608a6b7af259fe721a0c052a5692f39144456fd0be48b76dbf4de3a448","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2505.21774, 'The friendship paradox for trees'] {\bf [Densities of vertex types for infinite trees]}

\begin{itemize}
