    Here, convergence is as $C(\mathbb{R}^{4}_{\uparrow})\times C(\mathbb{R}^{4}_{\uparrow})$-valued random variables. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

