	\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.384167+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da639a604672a63ae4402594aeb0bca9e46aa2bc77eed1776c807a40b2f01b88","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 of arXiv:2609.03248, 'Connections between colored restricted $b$-ary and ordinary partitions'] Given positive integers $k$ and $n$, the following are identical:
