{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.412885+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da6b52278815a0972aa7633a33498bfcc6329c90f0c344e91e671245ac78dad1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 62 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Suppose that Assumptions~\ref{Assumptions_Theta} and \ref{Assumptions_basic}
