{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.772898+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da9a0cd88adba4ac2159c4d520a79bf7f9c796bb6098d4e74c0c152c85da21c4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 18 of arXiv:2607.10102, 'Dynamical mean-field limit and replica-symmetric free energy for the orthogonally-invarian'] Suppose $U:\R \to \R$ is any potential taking the form
