{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.195673+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_db4eee8d20bd58c71fed11635ee16fa3a65239d327bae361776051561d38edac","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 22 of arXiv:2605.03851, 'The Relay Random Tree:\\A stochastic geometry approach of multihop relay in an urban visib'] \textbf{Reverse Shade the in finite range case.}

