{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.058729+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dba46fc6c2fa5c631269bfee035bd3e96db0a68ef045cace8289602c538cd9b1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2606.19313, 'Stability of Khintchine-type inequalities via log-monotonicity'] Let $q\geq 2$ be an integer. For $a\in\mathbb{R}^n$ satisfying $\sum_ka_k^2=1$, define
