{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:00:46.842840+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dbd4796f3e0635eb7d4b3f4739ca34d0f995f1b385335736c033d8d37d6705ba","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 8 of arXiv:2608.13631, 'The classical discrete laws near the mode:\\ complete local expansions for the negative bi'] Under the hypotheses of Theorem~\ref{thm:hyp-main}, with $k=\mu+t$,
