{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.386382+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dbd66060b1974d50e6235c953243e0e86a4006dd0518e223f8ba23fef5d869d2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:global_subgraph_clt_intro of arXiv:2507.10531, 'Quantitative central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] Recall the definition of $\sigma_n^2$ from (equation eq:sigmadef_global_intro of the paper).
