{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:22:59.721242+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc59520e2b1f5e8a26ef11d7d9e013800c0be83e675b3e3ebaadccab8a61c2b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Persistency of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] Let $\mathfrak{M} = (W, \leq, V)$ be an i-model, and take any $\varphi \in \mathscr{L}_p$.
