{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.367734+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc97b5817fe856ac9636dc74c93aba438bdf001ba2cb9a06eeab9eb68b80a0f3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:IBP-with-cutoff of arXiv:2412.01645, 'Regularisation by Gaussian rough path lifts of fractional Brownian motions'] Let $s\in[0,1]$, $a>0$, $d,d_1, k\in\mathbb{N}$, $\chi'\in\mathrm{Cut}_{d_1}$,

