{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:27.994358+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dcc4cf9c5760e74ce69cf64288aef3ddc32120ee0eaaa21f12070fe040ec80fe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Weak-$L^2$ logarithmic force estimate) of arXiv:2608.24863, 'Uniform Logarithmic Sobolev Inequalities for the 2D Coulomb Gas at the Diffusive Temperatu'] There is a universal $C$ such that
