{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.859657+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dd0310308cce60f14e86107196e289ac78e46d2f236ea4bc7cb6461791003c39","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 9 of arXiv:2608.21090, 'Ornstein--Uhlenbeck process conditioned to have restricted $L_2$-norm'] Let $\alpha>\frac13$ and take $r$ as defined by \eqref{eq:defr(c)}.
