{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:20:07.901645+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dd362750250fca519c9e02c3bbd7956a891dfadb702655718976775c14a0c0ef","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma quadraticterm of arXiv:2608.23765, '\texorpdfstring{Tight Majorizations and Convergence Rates\\ of Nuclear Norm Minimization I'] Assume that
