{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.354675+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dd6373cd95777b8072a091301a21f68e93159858ab7838b930527981b2d240cf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 of arXiv:2506.16260, 'Fractional Compound Poisson Random Fields on Plane'] The distribution of STFPRF is given by
